<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="MRK" style="id" />
  <para style="h">Markus</para>
  <para style="toc3">Mrk.</para>
  <para style="toc2">Markus</para>
  <para style="toc1">Abar Mafia ta Markuse nlefo</para>
  <para style="mt">Markus</para>
  <para style="mt2">Abar Mafia ta Markuse nlefo</para>
  <para style="imt">Kitab tae ni fanfanna</para>
  <para style="ip">
    <char style="bd">Abar Mafia</char>: Kitab Markus tae, jaga tu, “Abar Mafia” (B. Ind: Injil). Ni caritana Jou Lahatalla ncula Yesus Kristus nlafo mali dunia tae, ga ise be ta ndela I, smat cia ni dosana osta nduk ampung fare i osta ntub re Jou Lahatalla denabe lali.</para>
  <para style="ip">
    <char style="bd">Smat ta nlefo kitab tae</char>: Lal smat ta rto Kitabna du, ta nlefo Kitab tae Markus. Markus cia, Petruse ni del i. Markuse nlonga Yesuse ni caritana lal mali Petrus i. Markuse ngahnyo nesana Yohanes (Kis. 12:12). Markus tae smat ta nderera farerer re Paulus fare Barnabas bo n'gali si oras ta si rfanna laspa taga bahnga tina bo rfabinga Yesus Krsituse ni Abar Mafia (Kis. 12:25). Mali kitab ta nesana, Pauluse nu bena, Markus cia smat ta n'gali i oras ta i npei Jou we ni karajanna (2Tim. 4:11).</para>
  <para style="ip">
    <char style="bd">Kitab tae bo ise:</char>: Kitab Markus tae rlefo i bo smat ta rteteam potalil mali batang ta Yesuse nfanye ni karajanna, ga si tina smat Yahudi si pa. Si tane dema re mtari pilupa mfalaisa Yesuse ntubna, fare farumi ta Yesuse npeie tona. Gabe si tane rcangnangna gaole, ningalena Markuse nlefo tane bo npo si, fare laina, si rto Yesus gabe rdela I.</para>
  <para style="ip">
    <char style="bd">Sogaro mali kitab tae:</char> Mali kitab tae, Markuse nafetang Yesuse ni kawasana. Nafetang Yesuse nfamafia smat ta dowilna, nfapaling hawe smat ta rmatna, nampung smat ta rbaradosa, fare ta nesana hawe. Markuse nlefo farumi carita tina, bo smat ta dem Yesus pana, bisa rto farumi mujizat fare fafayal ta Yesuse npei bo nfaeme Jou Lahatalla ni kawasa. Re laina, si rto, Yesus cia Lahatalla ntu I fare I cia Kolano ta nfasalamate smatca (Mrk. 1:1, 11, 24, 3:11, 5:7, 8:29, 9:7, 14:61-62, 15:39). Markuse nlefo kitab tae bo nfasangnang si hawe bo ahai ta si rbona, si rderera be Yesus (Mrk. 8:34-38, 10:29-31).</para>
  <para style="ip">Ga mali cicapo kitab tae, Markuse nafetang mfalaisa ta rfaboboko agama Yahudina diyawa lalinge bo rpun famat Yesuse. Markuse ma nafetang hawe mfalaisa smatna riri le Yesusna, rfakangela i, fare rcalip I denabe nmat (Mrk. 15). Ga mali wol ta faicolica, Yesuse npaling hawe, fare hola tina I nfaemi mali smat ta rderera Ina, taga ncula ni muritna rfan lali farumi dunia tae bo rfabinga Abar Mafia mali Jou Lahatalla i mali farumi smat (Mrk. 16).</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="MRK 1" />
  <para style="s">Yohanes ta nfasisopca ncula smatna rfola to rpei salna bo rderera Yesus</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MRK 1:1" />Tane Abar Mafia mali Yesus Kristus i, Jou Lahatalla Ntuca. <verse eid="MRK 1:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MRK 1:2" />Ta ntuba be, Abar Mafia tae rlefo i to mali Kitab nabi Yesaya laitane,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MRK 1:2">“Ftarokira e! Ya bo isula nik susulaca nlafo ntuba mali Awi.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MRK 1:2">I cia ta bo nfapepeya laling mali Awi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MRK 1:2">bo smatna rtotoman aw.<verse eid="MRK 1:2" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="MRK 1:3" />Mali padang gurun, gagaw isa ta namlilei, fare nalaspa mali pnu i,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MRK 1:3">i bo nmautingna nfacicoali lali smat ta rfayalo si manana laitane,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MRK 1:3">‘Fapepeya lalingna bo failow Jou,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MRK 1:3">faolang lalingna bo ftotoman I.’ ”<verse eid="MRK 1:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="MRK 1:4" />Jouca ni susula cia Yohanes ta nfasisopca. I bo nlafo mali padang gurun, gagaw ta namlilei fare nalaspa mali pnu i, manana I nfabinga smatna laitane, “Fiwane wlomewna to bo fderera Jou Lahatalla, fare laina Jou Lahatalla bo nampunge mew. Gabe fpo nimew dirica to bo ncisope mew, cia fafayali mewe nimew dirica bo fduk sisop, tina fafayali mewe fiwane wlomewna to.”<verse eid="MRK 1:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="MRK 1:5" />Fare smatna lal si mali bendar Yerusalem fare mali gagawe nesana mali batang Yudea rlafo Yohanes. Si rfatuwo riri dosana, gabe Yohanese ncisop si mali waya Yordan. <verse eid="MRK 1:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MRK 1:6" />Yohanese npake juba mali unta pluna. I ni pitpitane hnyaoca mali aiwani gico. I na an na mali kasiso fare madu ailolo. <verse eid="MRK 1:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MRK 1:7" />Tane hawe ta i nua smat ta pulinana, “Lomanta ya fola, smat isa bo nlafo, I ni kawasana mamagal foloi mali Ya i. Bo isalawe ni nal tasa bere ya bisapa. <verse eid="MRK 1:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MRK 1:8" />Ya isope mew ipake waya, ga I ncisope mewna npake Jou ni Rohca.”<verse eid="MRK 1:8" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yohanese ncisop Yesus</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="MRK 1:9" />Oras ta Yohanese en ncisope smat, Yesuse nlafo mali Nasaret mali batang Galilea, gabe Yohanese ncisop I mali waya Yordan. <verse eid="MRK 1:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MRK 1:10" />Yesuse bo ncapang mali wayacana, I nem langitca nmarapaw, Jou ni Rohca laisa mani pombona nduri nap Yesus I. <verse eid="MRK 1:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MRK 1:11" />Gabe, rlonga Jou Lahatalla lio mali sorogaca laitane, “Aw tane Ya ntu Aw, Ya igogoru Aw. Aw ta mpei wlokna sangnang.”<verse eid="MRK 1:11" /></para>
  <para style="s">Setanna riri kolanoca nyakul Yesus</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="MRK 1:12" />Folana tina, Jou ni Rohca nut Yesus lali padang gurun, gagaw isa ta namlilei fare nalaspa mali pnu i. <verse eid="MRK 1:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MRK 1:13" />Yesuse nteteam mali padang gurun mnuwona wol yafafat. Mana setanna riri kolanoca nyakul I. I nteteam pulinana i re aiwanina gabe Malaikatna rleleyane I.<verse eid="MRK 1:13" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesuse mulaine nfabinga Abar Mafia mali Jou Lahatalla I mali batang Galilea</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="MRK 1:14" />Oras Yohanes ta nfasisopca ncung bui, Yesuse nfan lali batang Galilea, nfabinga Abar Mafia mali Jou Lahatalla I pulina. <verse eid="MRK 1:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MRK 1:15" />I nu laitane, “I ni oras ta Jou Lahatalla nuna nlafoito.”<verse eid="MRK 1:15" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesuse nololaw ni murit ta ntuba molangca.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="MRK 1:16" />Bahnga laitane, Yesuse nnfan ndel mali talaga Galilea mtopona. I nem smat silu rfatenow, si ngahnyorina Simon fare Andreas. Smat silu tasine dajala iyan mali talagaca, ningalena si riri karajanca diyawa be iyan. <verse eid="MRK 1:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MRK 1:17" />Gabe Yesuse nololaw si, “Mali bo fderera Ya! Mewe jaga fiyawa iyan, ga Ya bo ifafcule mew fiyawa smate bo rderera Ya.” <verse eid="MRK 1:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MRK 1:18" />Rlonga tina, smat silu tasa tina to rfateame riri jalana taga rderera Yesus.<verse eid="MRK 1:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="MRK 1:19" />Fola tina, Yesuse nfan lali faokoce hawe, I nem Yakobus i re tenoca Yohanes. Smat silu tasine Zebedeuse ntu si. Si rfapepeya riri jalana mali pelang tasa lolo. <verse eid="MRK 1:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MRK 1:20" />Tina to Yesuse nololaw si, gabe si rderera Yesus. Si rfateame hmarica farerer re smat karajan ta en mali pelang tasana.<verse eid="MRK 1:20" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesuse nfaungo setan ta ncunge smatcaca</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="MRK 1:21" />Yesuse I re ni muritna rlafo mali Kapernaum. Neta wol Sabat, Yesuse tina to ncung namu ebai sombayang agama Yahudina taga nfafcule mana. <verse eid="MRK 1:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MRK 1:22" />Smat ta manana rherang rlonga I ni sogaronana, ningalena I nfafcule sina re kawasa, laisa guru agama ta rto Musa ni kitab silim tasa pa. <verse eid="MRK 1:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MRK 1:23" />Oras ciana, en smat isa mali ebai sombayangca setane ncungi. Smatca n'gigam laitane, <verse eid="MRK 1:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="MRK 1:24" />“Ee Yesus smat Nasaret! Aw bo mpeo am ahai. Ya ito Aw ise. Aw tane smat ta mamolang mali Jou Lahatalla i mali.”<verse eid="MRK 1:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="MRK 1:25" />Ga Yesuse ntolea si liona nuto mamagal lali setan ta ncunge smatca, “Mati liomna! Aw msapang mana!”<verse eid="MRK 1:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="MRK 1:26" />Fare setanca npei smatca denabe namderer. Oras ta smatca n'gigamna nfacicoal i, setanca ncapang. <verse eid="MRK 1:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="MRK 1:27" />Farumi smat ta en manana rherang, denabe si fauwo si, “Ya co mew ftarokira famafia! Tane sogaro po! I nmauting re ni kawasa, denabe setanna rderera ta I nuna.”<verse eid="MRK 1:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="MRK 1:28" />Mana mali, Yesuse ngahnyona ncapang mali farumi gagaw mali batang Galilea.<verse eid="MRK 1:28" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesuse nfamafia simone ohmo fare smate nesana</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="MRK 1:29" />Rcapang mali ebai sombayang agama Yahudi cia, Yesus, Yakobus fare Yohanes tina to rfan lali Simon fare Andrease riri ebaica. <verse eid="MRK 1:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MRK 1:30" />Oras tina, Simone ohmo ta mapingica namtuli, ningalena nowil. Tina to si rfabinga ni owilna lali Yesus I. <verse eid="MRK 1:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="MRK 1:31" />Fare Yesus I lali Simone ohmo i, nice kakamona taga nfapaling i. Oras ciato Simone ohmoca nmafia gabe i nleleyane si ga rceli.<verse eid="MRK 1:31" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="MRK 1:32" />Orasna bo doram, en ta rlafo dute ndumi smat ta dowilna fare ta setane ncung sina lali Yesus I, <verse eid="MRK 1:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="MRK 1:33" />denabe farumi smat ta en mali bendar ciana rlafo rfayalo si mali ebai cia nbona. <verse eid="MRK 1:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="MRK 1:34" />Gabe Yesuse nfamafia smatna lal ta riri rpanyaketna rupa laloi, I ma nfaungo setan ta rcunge smatnana. Yesuse npo si oras pa setanna bo rmauting, ningalena setan tina rto Ya ise.<verse eid="MRK 1:34" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesuse nfabinga Abar Mafia mali Ebai sombayang agama Yahudina</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="MRK 1:35" />Lase bo sema, Yesuse npalinge ga ncapang mali ebaica. I nfan lali gagaw ta mlileina bo ncombayang mana. <verse eid="MRK 1:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="MRK 1:36" />Simone i re ni delna rfanega diyawa I. <verse eid="MRK 1:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="MRK 1:37" />Oras ta si rfadukduk re Yesus si du, “Guru, smatna lal diyawa Guru.”<verse eid="MRK 1:37" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="MRK 1:38" />Yesuse nu, “Mali bo ite tfan lali gagaw ta nesana, mali bendar ta ndahle mantanena, bo Ya ifabinga Abar Mafia pulina hawe. Ningalena, Rcula Ya mali dunia taena bo ifabinga Abar Mafia tina.”<verse eid="MRK 1:38" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="MRK 1:39" />Fare, Yesuse nfan lali farumi gagaw mali batang Galilea. I nfabinga Abar Mafia mali Jou Lahatalla I lali sili mali ebai sombayang agama Yahudina, fare nfaungo setan ta rcunge smatnana.<verse eid="MRK 1:39" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesuse nfamafia smat isa npado</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="MRK 1:40" />En smat isa npanyaket pado nlafo lali Yesus I. Smatca nlu nap ta Yesuse nbona taga ndor fagali laitane, “Apa, gabe laisa mailow, Apa mfamafia ya.”<verse eid="MRK 1:40" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="MRK 1:41" />Yesuse nbasamna nmasie smat cia, gabe I nu laitane, “Ya ikailow aw mmafia. Gabe tane aw mmafia to!” <verse eid="MRK 1:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="MRK 1:42" />Oras tina to, smat cia ni padona mnyangis, gabe i ndadi nmafia.<verse eid="MRK 1:42" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" sid="MRK 1:43" />Tina to, Yesuse nua smatca nfani. Ga Yesuse nfawloyaneto i laitane, <verse eid="MRK 1:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="MRK 1:44" />“Mlolam e, mdel pa ta bo fabinga smatna, Ya ta ifamafia aw. Ga aw mfan lali imamca, bo i nem aw mafia to, fare aw nane mpo nim aiwani faisa bo rpoi sadaka lali Jou Lahatalla I laisa re ta nabi Musa nfasulana. Aw mpei laina bo ndadi fafayali i lali smatna, aw fatutua mafia to.”<verse eid="MRK 1:44" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" sid="MRK 1:45" />Ga smatca nfanega nafetngo smate nesana ahai ta ndadi i mali ina. Gabe, Yesuse nfaemi panto mali Bendarna, I nteteam be mali gagaw ta mlileina mali bendarna potalil. Biarega laina, smatna mali gagaw ahai be rlfo be lali II.<verse eid="MRK 1:45" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MRK 1" />
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="MRK 2" />
  <para style="s">Yesuse nfamafia smat isa nfanfan pa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MRK 2:1" />Maralapis wol pifis lalina, Yesuse nlolai hawe lali bendar Kapernaum. Ga smat ta pulinana rlonga Yesus i mali ebai i. <verse eid="MRK 2:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MRK 2:2" />Gabe smatna lal rlafo rfayalo si, denabe gagaw panto, mali bawaca nbona ma kose to ningalena smatna lal. Mana, Yesuse nfabinga si Jou Lahatalla ni mautingna. <verse eid="MRK 2:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MRK 2:3" />Oras ciana, en smat sifate rlafo. Si dute smat isa nfanfan pa lali Yesus I. <verse eid="MRK 2:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MRK 2:4" />Ga smatna lalna uatu, gabe smat cia duti lali Yesus I pa. Si rcalawe ebaica ni ta puisona, neta mali Yesuse bobokoca nais. Nmasalawe to, si rfadurea smat ta nfanfan pa cia, bahnga be re ni musala ta npake namtulo ica. <verse eid="MRK 2:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MRK 2:5" />Oras ta Yesuse nem ahai ta si rpeina, Yesuse nto si rdela I. Fare Yesuse nua smat ta nfanfan pa cia, “Tenok taw, anim dosana Ya ifayangise to.”<verse eid="MRK 2:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="MRK 2:6" />Ga en hawe guru agama sifis ta rto Musa ni kitab silim tasa rtotolang mana, ga si du mali wlorina laitane, <verse eid="MRK 2:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MRK 2:7" />“I mdel pa ta bo nu laina. I npei ni dirica laisa Jou Lahatalla. Ningalena, smatna isa pa ta bo nfayangis smat na riri dosana, ga Jou Lahatalla be.”<verse eid="MRK 2:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="MRK 2:8" />Ga Yesuse nto wlorina, gabe nua si laitane, “Pesaga mewe fututa lainana? <verse eid="MRK 2:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MRK 2:9" />Oras ta Ya ikua smat ta nfanfan pa tae, ‘Anim dosana nduk ampunge to,’ mewe fdelana uatu pa smat tae ni dosana nduk ampunge to. Gabe laisa Ya iku, ‘Mpalinge bo mlange nim musalaca fare mfane to,’ mewe osta fto Ya nik kawasa ningalena mew osta fem i nfane to. <verse eid="MRK 2:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MRK 2:10" />Gabe oras tae Ya bo ifamafia i bo mewe fto, mali dunia taena, Smat ta mali Sorogaica ni kawasa bena bo nampunge smatna riri dosa.” Gabe Yesuse nua smat ta nfanfan pa cia, <verse eid="MRK 2:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MRK 2:11" />“Ya ikua aw, mpalinge to, mlange nim musalaca, muwe to lali nim ebai!”<verse eid="MRK 2:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="MRK 2:12" />Gabe smat ta nfanfan pa cia npaling, tina to nlange ni musalaca taga ncapang natalil ndel mali smat laloca nbona. Farumi smatna rgarayane ndumi, gabe si rfamamagal fare rcuba Jou Lahatalla fare du laitane, “Momofia pa, bahnga paube bo ite tem ta mfalainana.”<verse eid="MRK 2:12" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesuse nololaw Lewi bo nderera I</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="MRK 2:13" />Yesuse nfan hawe lali Talaga Galilea mtopona. Pulina ma smatna lal rlafo I, gabe Infafcule si.<verse eid="MRK 2:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="MRK 2:14" />Fola tina, Yesuse nfan hawe, fare I nem smat isa ngahnyo Lewi. I cia Alfeuse ntu i. Lewi tae jaga nfautno pajak. I ntotolang mali gagaw ta si biasa rkarajanna, gagaw ta smatna rpalas pajakna. Yesuse nua i, “Mali, bo mderera Ya!” Lewi nlonga tina, nosale ga nderera Yesus.<verse eid="MRK 2:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="MRK 2:15" />Oras ta Yesuse I re ni muritna rfane rceli mali Lewi ni ebaica. Mana ma en bena smat ta biasa nfautno pajakna lal fare smate nesa ta smatna du si rbaradosa. Si rtotolang rceli farerer re Yesus fare ni muritna, oras ciana smatna lal ta rderera Yesusna. <verse eid="MRK 2:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MRK 2:16" />Oras ciana ma, en guru agama Yahudi ta rto Musa ni kitab silim tasa, ga si bena ta rderera fatfato ta ngahnyo Farisi. Si dem Yesuse nceli farerer re smat ta rfautno pajakna fare smate nesa ta du si rbaradosa tina. Gabe si dua Yesuse ni muritna, “Ya, pesaga I nceli re smat ta rfautno pajakna fare smat ta rbaradosa nesanana?”<verse eid="MRK 2:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="MRK 2:17" />Yesuse nlonga si du tina, I nua si laitane, “Ga smat ta rcehatna pa, ta rparlu mamana, ga smat ta dowilna, tina ni ngale, Ya ilafo bo ikololaw smat ta damolangna pa, ga Ya ilafo bo ikololaw smat ta nbaradosaca bo rderera Ya.”<verse eid="MRK 2:17" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesuse ni muritna rpuasa pa oras ta I re si subena</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="MRK 2:18" />Bahnga laitane, Yohanes ta nfasisopca ni muritna fare smat Yahudi ta rderera fatfato Farisina rpuasa. Ga smat diranca rlafo rfautno Yesus, “Pesaga Yohanese ni muritna fare smat Farisi riri muritna rpuasa, ga Apa anim muritna rpuasa pa?”<verse eid="MRK 2:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="MRK 2:19" />Gabe Yesuse ncanglo si npake andeande, “Ya tane fatailo laisa man ta nfasawca. Gabe laisa man ta nfasawca i mali rame fasawca sube, i ni deldelona osta rpuasa? Enpa'o bo ni deldelona rpuasa gabe laisa i nfarerer re sil sube. <verse eid="MRK 2:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MRK 2:20" />Ga osta en ni orasna, smate nesa bo jal man ta nfasaw cia mali sili. Oras cia taga rpuasa.”<verse eid="MRK 2:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="MRK 2:21" />Gabe Yesuse nu hawe npake andeande laitane, “Smatna osta isa pa ta rdilip obat po rpake pake agona, ningalena gabe laisa bo rtosfa obat cia, pake po ta rdilpe ica osta nfalululo i, gabe kabaya ago cia osta nmarasekanna mamagal hawe. <verse eid="MRK 2:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MRK 2:22" />Laina bena, enpa smat ta dafrai anggur ta po mali anggur gagaw ta agona. Ningalena gabe laisa anggur gagao mali aiwani gico cia ago ito, i ni gicoca ncicoal. Gabe, laisa smatna dafrai anggur po mali gagaw ta agona, anggur ta pona nca, anggur ta pona osta nfarapes anggur gagaw ta agona, gabe anggur tina maraepa. Gabe, ta pona nane tising mali gagaw ta po bena.”<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">2:22 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Yesus npei andeande mali ayat 21-22, bo si rto Yesuse ni fatfato ta pona cia ma tfabanga re rir adat ta ntuba mali nana.</char></note><verse eid="MRK 2:22" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesuse ni kawasa bo nfato ahai ta smatna rpei mali wol Sabat</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="MRK 2:23" />Bahngana, neta wol sabat, wol ta smat agama Yahudina bisa rkarajan pa, Yesuse I re ni muritna rfan rdel mali bet gandumca. Oras ta si rfanna, Yesuse ni muritna rkati gandum ese. <verse eid="MRK 2:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="MRK 2:24" />Mana, en bena smat Yahudi ta rderera fatfato Farisi, si dua Yesus, “Mem tina! Pesaga si rkarajan rkati gandum mali wol Sabat? Tina si rcapial ite rir agamaca ni fatfatona!”<verse eid="MRK 2:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="MRK 2:25" />Gabe Yesuse nua si, “Mew fbaca to, carita mali Jou Lahatala ni Kitabca ga kolano Daut. Oras ta i re smat ta rderera ina rari an panto gabe rbibisil. <verse eid="MRK 2:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MRK 2:26" />Kolano Daute ncung namul Jou Lahatalla ni Ebai ta rpeo i Sombayangca, taga nan roti ta rpeo sadaka lali Jou Lahatalla ina. Ga roti tina, gabe laisa tderera ite rir agamaca ni fatfatona, imam nabe ta danna. I ma noce smat ta rderera i na. Oras ta tina ndadi ina, Abyatar ta ndadi imam mamagal.”<verse eid="MRK 2:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="MRK 2:27" />Yesuse nmauting hawe lali sili, “Wol sabat cia, Jou Lahatalla npei bo smatna rfafolfola si, enpa ta bo ndadi kangela i bo smatna rderera. <verse eid="MRK 2:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="MRK 2:28" />Gabe, Smat ta mali sorogaica ni kawasa bo nfato ahai ta smatna rpei mali wol Sabat.”<verse eid="MRK 2:28" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MRK 2" />
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="MRK 3" />
  <para style="s">Yesuse nfamafia smatna neta wol Sabat</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MRK 3:1" />Fola tina, Yesuse nlolai hawe lali ebai sombayang agama Yahudina. Mana en smat isa kakamo paona nmat. <verse eid="MRK 3:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MRK 3:2" />Fare en bena smat Yahudi ta rderera fatfato farisi. Si rningningo be Yesus. Gabe laisa Yesuse bo nfamafia smat cia mali wol sabat, wol ta smat agama Yahudina rkarajan pa tina, si rduk lalinge bo rfasala I. <verse eid="MRK 3:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MRK 3:3" />Yesuse nua smat ta kakamo pao nmatca laitane, “Mosal mali ta Ya i bo tane.”<verse eid="MRK 3:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="MRK 3:4" />Gabe Yesuse nfautno smat ta en manana, “Gabe laisa tderera fatfato ta en mali Musa ni kitab silim tasa, manca ta ite bo tpeina mali wol sabatca? Tpei okosesi ta mayai pare tpei okosesi ta mafia? Tfasalamate smat pare tpune smat?” Ga si liori pa.<verse eid="MRK 3:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="MRK 3:5" />Yesuse wloyancusa ningalena si wlorina cicoal. I natngalo ndumi si fare nbasamna ntole, gabe I nua smat ta kakamo pao nmat cia, “Mpo mali kakamomna.” Fare smatca npo kakamona, tina to kakamona mafia. <verse eid="MRK 3:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MRK 3:6" />Oras tina to, smat Yahudi ta rderera fatfato Farisina rcapang mali Ebai sombayang cia tina to si rfator re kolano Herodes ni smatna bo rpun Yesus rfamati.<verse eid="MRK 3:6" /></para>
  <para style="s">Smatna lal rderera Yesus</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="MRK 3:7" />Yesuse I re ni muritna rdirak si mali smat laloca, taga rfan lali talaga Galilea. Ga smat mali batang Galileana lal rderera I. En bena smat mali batang Yudea, <verse eid="MRK 3:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MRK 3:8" />bendar Yerusalem, batang Idumea, fare mali batang waya Yordan pulipao, fare mali bendar ta en mali Tirus fare bendar Sidon. Si tina rderera Yesus sube, ningalena si rlonga to ahai ta I npeina. <verse eid="MRK 3:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MRK 3:9" />Smat ta rlafona lal, denabe Yesuse ncula ni muritna rfasadia pelang asa, bo I ncapil, bo mati I nfakoskoso I re smat lalo cana. <verse eid="MRK 3:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MRK 3:10" />Ningalena, I nfamafia smatna lale to, gabe smat ta dowilna lal hawe rlafo rfakoskoso si lali ningalena bo dice I. <verse eid="MRK 3:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MRK 3:11" />Laina bena smat ta setane ncung sina laisa dem Yesus, tina to si rlu nap Yesuse nbona, taga rgigam, “Awe to Jou Lahatalla Ntu Aw.”<verse eid="MRK 3:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="MRK 3:12" />Ga Yesuse nfabinga si, “Mdel pa ta bo ffabinga smatna, Ya ise.”<verse eid="MRK 3:12" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesuse nololaw ni murit yafasa re silu tasa bo rderera I</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="MRK 3:13" />Fola tina, Yesuse ndawil nais lolas isa. Mana, I nololaw si ta I nfisang si tona, gabe si rlafo lali. <verse eid="MRK 3:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="MRK 3:14" />I nfisang smat yafasa re silu bo rfarerer re I, fare I bo ncula rfane bo rfabinga smaatna Jou Lahatalla ni Abar Mafia. <verse eid="MRK 3:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MRK 3:15" />I ma npo si kawasa bo silema rfaungo setan.<verse eid="MRK 3:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="MRK 3:16" />Smat yafasa re silu ta Yesuse nfisang si tasa ngahnyorina tane: Simon (ta Yesuse nfanganyo i Petrus), <verse eid="MRK 3:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MRK 3:17" />Yakobus i re tenoca Yohanes (Zebedeuse ntu si), Yesuse nfanganyo smat silu tasa, ‘Boanerges’, ta ni ngalena liorina mamagal laisa dubna, <verse eid="MRK 3:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MRK 3:18" />Andreas, Filipus, Bartolomeus, Matius, Tomas, Yakobus (Alfeuse ntu i), Tadeus, Simon (ta bo nfaungo smat Roma ta rkawasa mali riri batang Israelna), <verse eid="MRK 3:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MRK 3:19" />fare Yudas Iskariot (ta bo nwage Yesusca).<verse eid="MRK 3:19" /></para>
  <para style="s">Smatna du Yesuse nfaungo setanna npake Beelzebul</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="MRK 3:20" />Fola tina, Yesuse ncung mali ebai isa. Mana, smatna lal ta rlafo rfayalo si hawe, denabe I re ni muritna bisa rceli pa. <verse eid="MRK 3:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="MRK 3:21" />Oras ta Yesuse teno re ramana rlonga tina, si rlafo bo jal Yesus, ningalena smatna du Yesuse wlona tengtengan pa.<verse eid="MRK 3:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="MRK 3:22" />Guru agama ta rto Musa ni kitab silim tasa rlafo mali Yerusalem, taga du laitane, “Smat tae Beelzebule setanna riri kolanoca, tina ta npei denabe I nfaungo setanna!”<verse eid="MRK 3:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="MRK 3:23" />Yesuse nololaw guru agama Yahudi tina, taga nmauting re si npake andeande laitane, “Mfalaisa ga setanna bo rfaungo setannana? <verse eid="MRK 3:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="MRK 3:24" />Gabe mali kerajaan isa rfakotale be ga rfasaksake si, ta molangna kerajaan cia osta namjakam. <verse eid="MRK 3:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MRK 3:25" />Gabe laisa man re maping ese rfakotale ga rfasaksake si, ta molangna riri fasawca osta nmayai. <verse eid="MRK 3:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MRK 3:26" />Laina bena re setanna riri kolanoca. Gabe laisa setanna riri kolanoca nfakotale re ni wawai setanna, si osta rfasaksake si. Fare setanna riri kolanoca ni karajanna bo mjakam fare mnyei.<verse eid="MRK 3:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="MRK 3:27" />Andeande laitane, smatna isa pa ta bo ncung mali smat ta ncicoalca ni ebaica taga nloise ni aratana. I nane npitane smat ta ncicoalca su taga nloise ni aratana.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">3:27 </char><char style="fq">Smat ta ncicoalca</char> tina, setanna riri kolanoca. Yesuse nu laina, ningale I be ta nfoloi mali setanna riri kolano cia, I be ta nafena npitan ina. Laina bena, Yesus ta bisa nfaungo setanna ta ncungo smatna.</note><verse eid="MRK 3:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="MRK 3:28" />Mewe flonga famafia e, farumi dosa ta smatna rpeina nduk ampung sube, laina bena fare ta du mauting ta mayai lali smatnana rduk ampun sube. <verse eid="MRK 3:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="MRK 3:29" />Gabe smatna du mauting ta mayai lali Jou Lahatala ni Rohca, i osta nduk ampung pa denabe lali, ningalena i npei dosa ta bisa nduk ampung pa.” <verse eid="MRK 3:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MRK 3:30" />Yesuse nu laitane, ningalena si du, I setane ncungi.<verse eid="MRK 3:30" /></para>
  <para style="s">Smat ta npei Jouca ni karajanna, cia Yesuse ni smat i</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="MRK 3:31" />Oras ta Yesuse nfafcule, I hma re tenona rlafo. Oras ciana si dosal po talil, si rcula smatna dololaw Yesus. <verse eid="MRK 3:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="MRK 3:32" />Mali ebai ciana, smatna lal rtotolang jel Yesus. Gabe si dua Yesus “Apa, hma re tenomna si po talil, bo rfaduduk re Apa.”<verse eid="MRK 3:32" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="MRK 3:33" />Ga Yesuse nua si, “Ya hmak re tenokna ise i ga?”<verse eid="MRK 3:33" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="MRK 3:34" />Yesuse natngalo si smat ta rtotolange jelina, fare nu laitane, “Farumi mew tane Ya hmake re tenoke mew! <verse eid="MRK 3:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="MRK 3:35" />Ningalena, ise npei ta Jou Lahatalla nfasulana, i cia to Ya, hmake re tenok si.”<verse eid="MRK 3:35" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MRK 3" />
  <chapter number="4" style="c" sid="MRK 4" />
  <para style="s">Andeande gei ta ntub mali rakrak fara pifat</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MRK 4:1" />Bahnga laitane, Yesuse nfafcule hawe mali talaga Galilea mtopona. Mana smatna lal rfayalo si rlafo lali I. Gabe I ndawil nais pelang ta rcowla si tasa, taga ntotolang mana, taga smat ta lalna si mali talaga ca mtopo. <verse eid="MRK 4:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MRK 4:2" />Mana Yesuse nfafcule si okosesina lal, npake andeande. I nu laitane, <verse eid="MRK 4:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MRK 4:3" />“Flonga famafia! En smat isa nfane ncake gei mali beti. <verse eid="MRK 4:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MRK 4:4" />Oras i ncake gei tina, en gei ta marapawil mali lalingca, fare manina rlafo ga dan denabe mnyei. <verse eid="MRK 4:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MRK 4:5" />En gei ta nesanaa marapawil mali rakrak ta ni pat, ta ni nyinyenna okoce be. Gei ta marapawil tina fatoal be ntubna ningalena ni nyinyenna okocebe. <verse eid="MRK 4:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MRK 4:6" />Ga wolca nca, tatanam tina mlai fare mang, ningalena ni waca ncungna law pa. <verse eid="MRK 4:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MRK 4:7" />Ga en bena gei ta marapawil mali rakrak ta ni momna soga. Gei tina ntub, mom ta ni sogana nbangi ga nmamagal gabe nbalat tanam tina denabe nmat, gabe tatanaman tina piyo pa. <verse eid="MRK 4:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MRK 4:8" />Ga en gei nesa ta marapawil mali rakrak ta mafiana, ga ntub, fare piyo. Piyona denabe tutuaf yafatol, tutuaf yafawona fare en ta denabe tutuafe slubisa.” <verse eid="MRK 4:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MRK 4:9" />Yesuse nu hawe, “Flonga tina famafia fare fising mali wlomewna!”<verse eid="MRK 4:9" /></para>
  <para style="s">Andeande gei tina, Yesuse nfabinga ningalena</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="MRK 4:10" />Laina motle be Yesuse ntutuling, I ni murit smat yafasa re silu fare smat ta rderera I na, rfautno andeande cia ningalena. <verse eid="MRK 4:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MRK 4:11" />Gabe Yesuse ncanglo si, “Jou Lahatala npei bo mew fto mfalaisa Jou Lahatala bo Nkawasa ndadi Kolano mali smat ta rdela I na, ga mali smate nesana, tina Ya ifabinga ipake andeande, <verse eid="MRK 4:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MRK 4:12" />bo ahai ta Jou Lahatalla nuna ga si mali Jou ni Kitabcana tina ndadi to,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MRK 4:12">‘Biare ga si dem, si rtaif pa ahai ta demna.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MRK 4:12">Biare ga si rlonga, si rtaif pa ahai ta rlongana.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MRK 4:12">Si rtaif pa gabe si diwane wlorina pa fare rduk ampung pa.’ ”<verse eid="MRK 4:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="MRK 4:13" />Fola tina, Yesuse nua ni muritna fare smate nesa ta rderera I na laitane, “Gabe laisa mew ftaif pa andeande tae, mfalaisa mewe bo ftaif andeande ta nesa hawena? <verse eid="MRK 4:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="MRK 4:14" />Andeande ta nanaica ningalena laitane: smat ta ncake gei mali nabetca, cia laisa re smat ta nfabinga Jou Lahatalla ni mauting. <verse eid="MRK 4:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MRK 4:15" />Gei ta marapawil mali lalingcana, tina laisa smat ta rlonga Jou Lahatalla ni mauting. Rlonga fola, setanna riri kolanoca nlafo ga nyal Jou ni mauting tina mali si wlorina. <verse eid="MRK 4:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MRK 4:16" />Gei ta marapawil mali nyinyen ta ni patna, tina laisa smat ta rlonga Jou Lahatalla ni mauting, tina si jal re wlorina sangnang. <verse eid="MRK 4:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MRK 4:17" />Ga mauting tina, si dising famafia pa mali wlorina, gabe ntahanna mnu pa. Laina si rdu kangela fare sangsara ningalena si rdela Jou ni mauting tina, si rdela Jou panto hawe. <verse eid="MRK 4:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MRK 4:18" />Gei ta marapawil mali rakrak ta ni momna soga, tina laisa smat ta rlonga Jou ni mauting, <verse eid="MRK 4:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MRK 4:19" />ga si wlorina tengtengan pa re riri tubca, fare si le ma diyawa be arata fare rlokolo ta nesana. Gabe Jou ni mauting ta si rlongana rpeo pa, denabe mauting tina ni ningale pa. <verse eid="MRK 4:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MRK 4:20" />Ga gei ta marapawil mali rakrak ta mafiana, tina laisa smat ta rlonga Jou Lahatalla ni mauting, nyal fare rdela. Si tina smat ta rtubna rderera Jou ni mautingna, laisa gei ta ntub denabe piyo. En ta piyona tutuaf yafatol, en bena tutuaf yafawonam, fare en bena tutuafe slubisa.”<verse eid="MRK 4:20" /></para>
  <para style="s">Andeande poci ta rtabaki</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="MRK 4:21" />Fola tina, Yesuse nua si hawe laitane, “Enpa smatna rtaping poci taga rtabaki re paisa nesa penepa disingi mali baleca papapo, bo plangnona mati ncapangna. Ta molangna i osta nising i mali gagaoca. <verse eid="MRK 4:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MRK 4:22" />Tina ningalena, ahai ta oras tae tgoganna, osta smatna bo rto, fare farumi ta ncapang pana bo ncapang. <verse eid="MRK 4:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MRK 4:23" />Gabe flonga tina famafia fare fising mali wlomew.”<verse eid="MRK 4:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="MRK 4:24" />Fare Yesuse nu hawe laitane, “Ftarokira famafia ahai ta mew flonga tona. Gabe laisa mewe flolam famafia, Jou Lahatalla npei bo mewe ftaif, fare I nbange npei denabe mewe ftaifna foloi hawe. <verse eid="MRK 4:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MRK 4:25" />Ningalena, gabe laisa ise nyal ahai ta Ya ikuna, lomanta Jou Lahatalla n'gali i bo ntaifna lal. Ga smat ta rlonga pa ahai ta Ya ikuna, ahai ta i ntona, Jou Lahatalla osta nyal hawe mali ii.”<verse eid="MRK 4:25" /></para>
  <para style="s">Jou Lahatalla ni smatna laisa re gei ta ntubna</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="MRK 4:26" />Gabe Yesuse nu hawe laitane, “Jou Lahatalla nkawasa ndadi kolano lali I ni smatna, tina laisa re andeande tae: en smat isa ncake gei mali rakrakca. <verse eid="MRK 4:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="MRK 4:27" />Etnga be doram i namtuli denabe sema taga i npaling, ga wloyaneto panto gei tina. Ga gei tina ntub fare ntipa i denabe tigo. Smat ta ntiwa cia, i nto pa mfalaisa denabe gei tina mfalainana. <verse eid="MRK 4:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="MRK 4:28" />Ningalena rakrak cia tutuling ta nfapiyo i, mulaine ntipa ina, ohloca, denabe piyo. <verse eid="MRK 4:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="MRK 4:29" />Gabe laisa piyona ncimo to, smat cia tina to nkati i, ningalena ni orase to bo rfakati.”<verse eid="MRK 4:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="MRK 4:30" />Fola tina, Yesuse nua si hawe, “Gabe laisa Jou Lahatalla Nkawasa ndadi Kolano mali I ni smatna, ite bo fatailo re ahai? Bo tfamolang re andeande ahai? <verse eid="MRK 4:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="MRK 4:31" />Jou Lahatalla Nkawasa ndadi Kolano mulain mali smatna ese be, ga wol de wol nbangi ga lal, tina laisa tatanam ta peona nenena ta rtiwa i mali rakrakca. Peo tina, peo ta nenena molang mali dunia tae. <verse eid="MRK 4:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="MRK 4:32" />Gabe laisa peo cia rtiwa ito, i ntub ga ndadi tatanaman ta nmamagal mali farumi tanaman ta nesana mali bet lilewingca, denabe ni magalna ma ndadi mamagal gabe manina rpei fafual mana.”<verse eid="MRK 4:32" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="MRK 4:33" />Lal andeande laisa tinana, ta Yesuse npake bo nfabinga Jou ni mauting lali sili. I fafcule sina nderera ahai ta si osta rtaifna. <verse eid="MRK 4:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="MRK 4:34" />Yesuse jaga npake andeande, gabe laisa nfafcule mali smate nesana. Ga mali i re ni muritna, I nfaolang andeande cia ningalena.<verse eid="MRK 4:34" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="MRK 4:35" />Malingin cia, Yesuse nua ni muritna, “Mali to bo tfan lali talagaca pulipao.” <verse eid="MRK 4:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="MRK 4:36" />Fare si rfateam smat lalo cia taga rcaplo pelang asa rfarerer re Yesus. Taga si rfalai, fare pelang ta nesana rderera si. <verse eid="MRK 4:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="MRK 4:37" />Mnu pana, latanca ncicoal fare mumatna nlafo ncipange riri pelang tasa denabe wayana ncapil, gabe riri pelang tasa bo damduri. <verse eid="MRK 4:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="MRK 4:38" />Oras ciana Yesuse namtuli mali pelang tasa ni famulena npake popoje. Gabe ni muritna rfapaling I taga dua I, “Guru, Guru mfaduli am pa ga? Ame bo kmate to tane ya!”<verse eid="MRK 4:38" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="MRK 4:39" />Yesuse npalinge ga nfafola latanca fare mumatna, I nu, “Mfola to!, Mnine to!” Latan fare mumatna nfola, fare talagaca namninna gaole.<verse eid="MRK 4:39" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="MRK 4:40" />Fola tina, Yesuse nua ni muritna, “Pesaga mew famcaitna? Fare pesaga mew fdela Ya pa na?”<verse eid="MRK 4:40" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="MRK 4:41" />Yesuse ni muritna damcait gabe rfauwo si, “Latan fare mumatna rderera ta I nuna! Smat tae isega?”<verse eid="MRK 4:41" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MRK 4" />
  <chapter number="5" style="c" sid="MRK 5" />
  <para style="s">Yesuse nfaungo setan mali smat isa mali batang Gerasa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MRK 5:1" />Yesuse I re ni muritna rlafo mali talaga Galilea pulipao, mali smat Gerasana riri batang. <verse eid="MRK 5:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MRK 5:2" />Yesuse nduri mali pelang tasa, en smat isa nlafo mali piling goana. Smat cia setane ncung i. <verse eid="MRK 5:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MRK 5:3" />I jaga nteteam mali piling goa tina. I ncicoalna gaole, denabe smatna isa pa ta bo dafena rpitan ina makse rpake rante besi. <verse eid="MRK 5:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MRK 5:4" />Ningalena, lale to kakamo re ficona si rpitan re rante besi, ga i nfaorit be. Gabe smatna isa pa ta bo rtahan ina. <verse eid="MRK 5:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MRK 5:5" />Dorame re wol i gagaona mali piling goana fare mali popona, n'gigam fare jaga npune ni badanca npake pat denabe nyabat. <verse eid="MRK 5:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MRK 5:6" />Oras ta i nem Yesusna laspa subena, i nfarera lali Yesus i taga nlu nap Yesuse nbona. <verse eid="MRK 5:6" /><verse number="7-8" style="v" sid="MRK 5:7-8" />Fare Yesuse nua i, “Ee, setan! Aw msapang mali smat cia!”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MRK 5:7-8">Ga smat cia n'gigamna nfacicoal i, i nu, “Ado Yesus, Jou Lahatalla ta tigo molangca Ntu Aw! Aw bo mpeo ya ahai? Ya isasi iku Jou Lahatalla ngahnyo, mati mfakangela yana!”<verse eid="MRK 5:7-8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="MRK 5:9" />Yesuse nfautno setan ta i mali smat cia, “Aw nganyom ise?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MRK 5:9">Setanca ncanglo, “Amame ngahyomamna Legion, ga amam tane reni calan.” <verse eid="MRK 5:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MRK 5:10" />Ga setan ta mali smat cia ndorna nfola pa lali Yesus I, gabe laisa mailow mati nfaungo si mali batang tinana.<verse eid="MRK 5:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="MRK 5:11" />Laupa mali tina, en bouna lal ta diyawa an mali lolase ppuna. <verse eid="MRK 5:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MRK 5:12" />Ga setan tina rdor lali Yesus I laitane, “Msula ame ksung mali bou tina.”<verse eid="MRK 5:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="MRK 5:13" />Yesuse nderera ta si duna. Fare setan tina rcapang mali smat cia, taga rfane ga rcung mali bou tina. Bou tina bo sal pa lalorina lalan lu. Fare bou tina rfarera rfacicoal si lali ta maratopasna, fare rtasapil nap talagaca gabe rmat.<verse eid="MRK 5:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="MRK 5:14" />Dem tina, smat ta rjaga bouna rfarera ga dafetang ahai ta ndadi i tina mali bendar fare pnu ta ndahle manana. Rlonga tina, tina to smatna rlafo bo dem ahai ta ndadi ina. <verse eid="MRK 5:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MRK 5:15" />Oras ta smatna rlafo lali Yesus I, si dem smat ta setane ncungica ntotolang mana, i nmafia to fare i npake kabaya to. Dem ta i nmafia tona, si ndadi damcait. <verse eid="MRK 5:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MRK 5:16" />Smat ta dem farumi tina, si dafetang ahai ta ndadi i tina lali smat po ta rlafona. Si dafetang ahai ta ndadi i mali smat ta setane ncungica fare ahai ta ndadi i mali bou tina. <verse eid="MRK 5:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MRK 5:17" />Rlonga tina, smat ta rteteam mali batang ciana rdore bo Yesuse ncapang mali si riri batang tina.<verse eid="MRK 5:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="MRK 5:18" />Oras ta Yesus ndawil hawe pelang tasa, smat ta setane ncungi nanaica nlafo, i dore bo nderera Yesus. <verse eid="MRK 5:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MRK 5:19" />Ga Yesuse nailow pa, gabe nua smat cia, “Ta mafiana, awe muwe to lali nim ebai i, taga mafetngo smat ta aw re si pnu isana, fare mua si ahai ta Jou ca npeo aw na, fare mu mfalaisa Jou ca nfaeme I ni masiena lali awi.” <verse eid="MRK 5:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MRK 5:20" />Fare smat cia nfane ga nfabinga smatna mali batang Dekapolis. I nfabinga ndumi ta Yesuse npeo ina, gabe farumi si ndadi rherang.<verse eid="MRK 5:20" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yairus ntuca npaling hawe, maping ta nem laflafca nmafia to</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="MRK 5:21" />Fola tina, Yesuse I re ni muritna rdawil pelang asa taga rlolai hawe lali talaga Galilea pulipao. Rlafo mali talaga cia pili pao, smatna lal rlafo rfayalo si jel Yesus mali talagaca lapo. <verse eid="MRK 5:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MRK 5:22" />En bena smat isa nlafo, i ngahnyo Yairus. Yairus cia nfaboboko mali ebai sombayang agama Yahudina isa. Laina i nem Yesus, i lali ga nlu nap Yesuse nbona. <verse eid="MRK 5:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MRK 5:23" />Yairuse ndor fare wlona molang lali Yesus I, i nu laitane, “Apa, mgali ntuk mapingca lae. I nowilna mamagal, denabe bo nmat. Apa mlafo su mali ebai i bo Apa fatige kakamomna mali ii, bo i nmafia fare mati nmatna.”<verse eid="MRK 5:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="MRK 5:24" />Nlonga tina, Yesuse nfan nderera Yairus. Oras ta si rfan, smatna lal rderera Yesus denabe rfakoskoso si. <verse eid="MRK 5:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MRK 5:25" />Mana en bena maping isa, i nowilna nfanye laflaf taun yafasa re failu to. <verse eid="MRK 5:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MRK 5:26" />Maping cia nfaloloila i beto nfalalalawna mali mamana, denabe ni tiwina mnyei, ga i nmafia pa. Ga ni panyaketna nfacicoulo i. <verse eid="MRK 5:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="MRK 5:27" />Maping cia nlonga smatna dafetang Yesuse nfamafia smat. Gabe biare smatna lal, i nfagelgeta i lali smatna fapaluan. I dahle Yesuse mali taona, gabe ndumi Yesuse ni jubaca. <verse eid="MRK 5:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="MRK 5:28" />I ndumi Yesuse ni jubaca ga mali i wlonana nu laitane, “Biarega idumi ni jubaca be, osta imafiya.” <verse eid="MRK 5:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="MRK 5:29" />Oras ta i ndumi Yesuse ni jubaca, tina to nfanye laflafna nfola i gabe nbasamna nmafiya to. <verse eid="MRK 5:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MRK 5:30" />Oras ta ndumi i, Yesuse nbasamna en kawasa ta ncapang mali I. Gabe I nfulasi ga nfautno smat laloca, “Ise ta ndumi Ya nik jubacaca?”<verse eid="MRK 5:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="MRK 5:31" />Yesuse ni muritna du, “Guru, mem tutuling. Smatna lal rfakoskoso sina, ga guru mfautan, ‘Ise ta ndumi Ya nik jubacaca?’ ”<verse eid="MRK 5:31" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="MRK 5:32" />Gabe Yesuse ninga lali re mali bo ntarokira ise ta ndumi ni jubacaca. <verse eid="MRK 5:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="MRK 5:33" />Maping cia namcaitna gaole denabe namderer, ningalena i nto i ta ndumi Yesuse ni jubaca denabe i nmafia. Gabe, i nlu nap Yesuse nbona taga nafetange ndumi mfalaisa denabe i nmafiana.<verse eid="MRK 5:33" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="MRK 5:34" />Gabe Yesuse nua maping cia, “Maping ta aw, mdela Ya gabe tane mfia to. Muwe to re wlomna tengtengan.”<verse eid="MRK 5:34" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="MRK 5:35" />Oras ta Yesuse nmauting sube, en smat sifis rlafo mali Yairuse ni ebaica mali. Si dua Yairus laitane, “Apa, apa ntumca nmate to, gabe mati mfaboboko ntoi Gurucana.” <verse eid="MRK 5:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="MRK 5:36" />Ga Yesuse faduli pa re ahai ta si du tina. I nua Yairus, “Mati mamcaitna! Mdela be.” <verse eid="MRK 5:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="MRK 5:37" />Fare Yesuse nfan lali Yairuse ni ebai i, ga I nailow pa smat laloca rderera I na. I nut be Petrus, Yakobus fare Yakobuse tenoca Yohanes. <verse eid="MRK 5:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="MRK 5:38" />Si rlafo mali Yairuse ni ebai i, Yesuse nem smatna rtangis fare rmasisewle mana, gabe tina ndadi liyaw. <verse eid="MRK 5:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="MRK 5:39" />Nem tina, Yesuse ncunge ga, nfautno smat tina, “Pesaga mew fpei liaw fare ftangisna? Waica nmat pa, i namtuli be.” <verse eid="MRK 5:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="MRK 5:40" />Ga si damlifa Yesus. Yesuse nua smat ta manana rcapang. Fola tina, Yesuse nut waica hma re hye, fare Yesuse ni muritna ta rfarerer Yesusna rcung mali waica ni kamar cia. <verse eid="MRK 5:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="MRK 5:41" />Pumul kamarca, Yesuse nice wai cia kakamona, fare nu, “Talita kum,” ta ningale, ‘Males ta aw, mpalinge to!’<verse eid="MRK 5:41" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" sid="MRK 5:42" />Yesuse nu laina, wai cia npaling fare nfan. Farumi smat ta dem ahai ta ndadi i tina, si rherangna gaole. (Wai cia ni umurna taun yafasa re failu.) <verse eid="MRK 5:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="MRK 5:43" />Fare Yesuse nua si, “Mdel pa ta bo fafetang ahai ta ndadi i to tina lali smate nesana.” Fola tina, Yesuse nua si rfatub wai cia.<verse eid="MRK 5:43" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MRK 5" />
  <chapter number="6" style="c" sid="MRK 6" />
  <para style="s">Yesuse smatna dailowi pa mali Nasaretna</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MRK 6:1" />Fola tina, Yesuse nuwe lali I ni pnu Nasaret, gabe ni muritna rderera I. <verse eid="MRK 6:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MRK 6:2" />Neta wol Sabat, Yesuse nfafcule mali ebai sombayang agama Yahudina. Smat ta manana rlonga Yesuse ni sogarona, si rherangna gaole, gabe rfauwo si laitane, “Ya, ga smat tae ni sogaro tina nto manca mali ga e? I npadena gaole? I nduk kawasa manca mali denabe npei mujizat tina? <verse eid="MRK 6:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MRK 6:3" />Ga I cia bas I, I ni aye Maria, tenona Yakobus, Yoses, Yudas fare Simon. I ramana ma en farerer re amam mantane paga?” Ningalena smat mantanena rto tina, gabe dailow I pa.<verse eid="MRK 6:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="MRK 6:4" />Gabe Yesuse nua si laitane, “Ga fatutua, manca be, smatna daraga nabi ta jaga rfalafo Jou Lahatalla ni fatnaw. Mali I ni pnuna tutuling, mali teno re ramana tutuling, fare mali i ni ebai tutuling si dailow i pa.”<verse eid="MRK 6:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="MRK 6:5" />Mali gagaw cia, Yesuse npei mujizatna lal pa, ningalena smat ta manana rdela I pa. I nfatig be kakamona mali smat sifis ta dowil fare si le ma rfamafia. <verse eid="MRK 6:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MRK 6:6" />I nherang, ni ngalena si rdela pa.</para>
  <para style="s" vid="MRK 6:6">Yesuse ncula ni murit yafasa re silu tasa</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MRK 6:6">Fola tina, Yesuse nfane nfafcule mali pnu isa fare mali pnu ta nesana. <verse eid="MRK 6:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MRK 6:7" />Yesuse nololawe ni murit yafasa re silu tasa, taga ncula si rfanna smat sililu. I ma npo si kawasa bo rfaungo setanna. <verse eid="MRK 6:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MRK 6:8" />Yesuse nfatnawe si bo mati dut fapaisana mali riri fanfacana. Ta si dutna titial be. Roti, nokon, tiwi mati dutna. <verse eid="MRK 6:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MRK 6:9" />Rpake nal, pake afiann mati dutna. <verse eid="MRK 6:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MRK 6:10" />Gabe Yesuse nua si hawe laitane, “Gabe mali gagaw isa en dailowe mewe to mali riri ebai i, fteteam mana denabe fsapang mali gagaw cia. <verse eid="MRK 6:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MRK 6:11" />Gabe laisa smat ta mali gagaw ciana dailow pa fare rlonga mew pa, mewe fateam si to. Pepesa ta mali ficomewna ffatartara mana to, bo ffauloyaneto si rcal mali Jou Lahatalla I.”<verse eid="MRK 6:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="MRK 6:12" />Rlonga fola tina, muritna rfane ga rfabinga smatna bo diwane wlorina rderera Jou. <verse eid="MRK 6:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MRK 6:13" />Si rfaungo setan, fare si le ma rmomsa egat lali smat ta dowilna bo smat ta dowilna rmafia.<verse eid="MRK 6:13" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yohanes ta nfasisopca rpun i ga nmat</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="MRK 6:14" />Manca-manca smatna dafetang Yesus, ningalena I ngahnyona ncapange to manca-manca, denabe kolano Herodes nlonga tina. En ta du, “Yesus cia Yohanes ta nfasisopca ta popiseica nmat, ga npaling hawe laha? Denabe I npei mujizat talalo i tina!”<verse eid="MRK 6:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="MRK 6:15" />En bena ta nesa du, “I cia nabi Elia!”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MRK 6:15">Fare en bena ta du, “I cia nabi nesa i ta nfalafo Jou Lahatalla ni fatnaw lali smatna, laisa nabi tantubana.”<verse eid="MRK 6:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="MRK 6:16" />Oras ta kolano Herodese nlonga smatna dafetang tina, i nu laitane, “I cia Yohanes ta nfasisopca, ta ya ikati bobokocaca. Oras tae i npaling hawe!”<verse eid="MRK 6:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="MRK 6:17" />Kolano Herodese nu laitane, ga popise ina ya ta ifasula rwagfo Yohanes, taga rpitan i re rante, taga rfasungai bui. I npei lainana poko be Herodias. Ni caritana laitane: kolano Herodes nyal Herodias taga npeo ni ngolo i. Naga, Herodiase nfasawe to re Filipus, kolano Herodese teno tutuo i. <verse eid="MRK 6:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MRK 6:18" />Gabe Yohanese ntolea kolano Herodesna nlolai ma nlolai, i nu laitane, “Apa mcapial Jou Lahatalla ni fatfatona, ningale apa mnyale nim tamai tutuoca taga mpeo nim ngolo i.” <verse eid="MRK 6:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MRK 6:19" />Oras ta Herodiase nlonga laina, i wlo ya mgo i mali Yohanes i, gabe i nusaha bo npun Yohanes denabe nmat. Ga Herodiase nduk oras paube, <verse eid="MRK 6:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MRK 6:20" />ningalena kolanoca ncula tentarana rjaga Yohanes famafia mali bui ciana. Kolano Herodes namcait Yohanes, ningalena i nto, Yohanes cia smat ta ntubna molang fare wlona beresi mali Jou Lahatalla nbona. Gabe tina, i nceya Yohanes. Biarega kolanoca wlona sangnang pa ga laisa Yohanese nmauting, i nlokolo nlonga.<verse eid="MRK 6:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="MRK 6:21" />Bahnga laitane, Herodiase nduk oras bo nbalco Yohanes wlo ta kangelana. Oras ciana kolano Herodese ni umurna nbangi gabe npei rame, i nololaw pamarentana fare tentara fare smat mamagal ta nesana mali batang Galilea. <verse eid="MRK 6:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MRK 6:22" />Oras rameca ndadi i, Herodiase ntu mapingca ncunge ga nowa. I nowana mafiana gaole, denabe kolanoca i re ni smat ta rlafona rcangnang. Gabe kolanoca nololaw Herodiase ntuca. Kolanoca nua i laitane, “Awe bo mdor ahai, mua ya mali, lomanta ya ipo!” <verse eid="MRK 6:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MRK 6:23" />Fare kolano Herodes njaji denabe ncasi mali wai mapingca, i nu, “Ahai be ta awe mdorna, ya osta ipo. Biarega nik kerajaan tae lowat fapaluane bo ipo aw.”<verse eid="MRK 6:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="MRK 6:24" />Nlonga kolanoca nu laina, wai mapingca nfan lali hnyei Herodias taga nfautan laitane, “Aye, ya bo idor ahai mali kolanocana?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MRK 6:24">I ni aye ncanglo, “Awe mdor Yohanes ta nfasisop bobokoca.”<verse eid="MRK 6:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="MRK 6:25" />Fare waica fatoal be nlolai hawe lali kolano Herodes i. Taga nu laitane, “Ya idor Yohanes ta nfasisop bobokoca, fising i mali loyang faisa tane to!”<verse eid="MRK 6:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="MRK 6:26" />Oras ta kolano Herodese nlonga ahai ta wai mapingca ndorna, i wlona kangelana gaole. Ga i ncasi to mali wai mapingca fare smat ta rlafona rbona, gabe ntaf pan to ahai ta wai mapingca ndornana. <verse eid="MRK 6:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="MRK 6:27" />Gabe tina to kolano Herodes ncula ni wawai isa nfan lali buica bo nkati Yohanese bobokoca. Gabe smatca nfane ga nkati Yohanese bobokoca. <verse eid="MRK 6:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="MRK 6:28" />Fare smat cia nising i mali loyang isa Yohanese bobokoca taga npo wai maping cia. Taga waica npo hnye. <verse eid="MRK 6:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="MRK 6:29" />Laina Yohanese ni muritna rlonga Herodese nkati Yohanese bobokoca, si rlafo ga jale ni mayatca taga rgaile i.<verse eid="MRK 6:29" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesuse nfatube smat lalan lim</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="MRK 6:30" />Yesuse ni murit ta rdadi susula si tasa rlolai taga rfayalo si farerer re Yesus. Fare rfabinga Yesus farumi ta si rpeina fare ta si rfafcule tona. <verse eid="MRK 6:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="MRK 6:31" />Ga oras ciana smat ta rlafo fare ta rfanna lalna uatu, denabe Yesus I re ni muritna riri oras pa bo rcelina. Gabe Yesuse nua ni muritna, “Mali to ite tfan lali gagaw ta mlileina bo tfafolfola it faokoce!”<verse eid="MRK 6:31" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="MRK 6:32" />Gabe Yesus I re ni muritna rdawil pelang asa taga rfan lali gagaw ta ndahle pnu pana bo si rtutuling mana. <verse eid="MRK 6:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="MRK 6:33" />Ga smat ta lalna dem si ta rfanna, fare si rto gagaw ta Yesuse I re ni muritna bo rfanyo ica. Gabe smat mali farumi pnuna rfan mali gagaw cia. Si rfanye ficori, ga si rtuba mali gagaw ta Yesus I re ni muritna bo rfanyo ica.<verse eid="MRK 6:33" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="MRK 6:34" />Oras ta Yesuse nduri mali pelang tasa, I nem smatna lal ta rtotoman I manana. I nmasie sina gaole ningalena sina laisa domba ta riri tuan pana gabe isa njaga si pa. Mana, Yesuse nmulaine nfafcule si okosesina lal.<verse eid="MRK 6:34" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="MRK 6:35" />Orasna bo doram, Yesuse ni muritna rlafo I, fare du, “Guru, gagaw tae nalaspa mali pnu i, fare bo doram. <verse eid="MRK 6:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="MRK 6:36" />Gabe ta mafiana Guru msula smat lalo tae rfane to, bo si rgon an mali pnu ta ndahle mantanena.”<verse eid="MRK 6:36" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="MRK 6:37" />Gabe Yesuse nua si laitane, “Mew ta nane ffaseli si!”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MRK 6:37">Si rcanglo Yesus, “Wataw, ga smat ta lalo itae! Ite nane tkarajanna re ningah su taga ite tduk tiwi bo tgone rari an ta lalo ica!”<verse eid="MRK 6:37" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="MRK 6:38" />Yesuse nua si, “Mewe fut rotina pifis lalona? Co fem!”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MRK 6:38">Deme fola, si dua Yesus, “Rotina pilim fare iyanna silu.”<verse eid="MRK 6:38" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="MRK 6:39" />Fare Yesuse ncula smat laloca ntotolang rpei puk-puk mali momna popo. <verse eid="MRK 6:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="MRK 6:40" />Gabe si rtotolangna rpei pukpuk, pukpuk isa smate slubisa, fare en bena smat yafalim. <verse eid="MRK 6:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="MRK 6:41" />Fola tina, Yesuse nyal roti pilim tasa fare iyan silu tasa, I nbo nais langitca taga nu tarima kase lali Jou Lahatalla I. Taga nfawogwogla rotina, taga npo ni muritna, bo si rpo smat ta en manana. Laina bena re iyan silu tasa, I nlow to si ndumi. <verse eid="MRK 6:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="MRK 6:42" />Si rceli ndumi denabe rmo si. <verse eid="MRK 6:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="MRK 6:43" />Rceli fola, Yesuse ni muritna rfayalo roti re iyan ta gleona, karanjang yafasa re pilu bakbak. <verse eid="MRK 6:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="MRK 6:44" />Ta dan roti wol ciana smat lalan lim, detang be manna.<verse eid="MRK 6:44" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesuse nfanfan puis wayaca popo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" sid="MRK 6:45" />Fola tina, Yesuse tina to ncula ni muritna rdawil pelange, bo rfane rtuba lali pnu Betsaida ta i mali talagaca puli pao. Oras ciana, I nua smat laloca duwe. <verse eid="MRK 6:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="MRK 6:46" />Oras ta smat laloca duwe, Yesuse ndawil nais popoca ga ncombayang.<verse eid="MRK 6:46" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="47" style="v" sid="MRK 6:47" />Orasna bo dorame to, Yesuse ni murit ta rdawil pelang tasa si mali talagaca fapaluan, Yesuse ntutuling sube po lei batang i. <verse eid="MRK 6:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="MRK 6:48" />Yesuse neme ni muritna dafena panto rcalina, ningalena latanca cicoal nuf mali uhngori mali. Lase bo sema Yesuse nlafo si, I nfanfan puis wayaca popo. Mali I wlonana bo naliw si, <verse eid="MRK 6:48" /><verse number="49" style="v" sid="MRK 6:49" />ga oras ta si dem Yesuse nfanfan puis wayaca popo, si dunama setan i gabe rgigam, <verse eid="MRK 6:49" /><verse number="50" style="v" sid="MRK 6:50" />ningalena si damcaitna gaole. Ga Yesuse tina to nua si laitane, “Fmalan, mati famcaitna, tae Ya!”<verse eid="MRK 6:50" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="51" style="v" sid="MRK 6:51" />Fare Yesuse ndawile riri pelang tasa, latanca ma nfola. Fare farumi si rherangna gaole. <verse eid="MRK 6:51" /><verse number="52" style="v" sid="MRK 6:52" />Ningalena, biarega si deme to Yesuse nfatube smat laloca, ga si rtaif pa ise I ya, ningalena si wlorina cicoal.<verse eid="MRK 6:52" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesuse nfamafia smat ta dowilna lal mali Genesaret</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="53" style="v" sid="MRK 6:53" />Yesuse I re ni muritna rlafo puli talagaca puli pao, si rcoal mali batang Genesaret. <verse eid="MRK 6:53" /><verse number="54" style="v" sid="MRK 6:54" />Rduri mali pelang tasa, smat laloca tina to rfayala cia Yesus. <verse eid="MRK 6:54" /><verse number="55" style="v" sid="MRK 6:55" />Farumi si rfarera lali farumi gagaw mali batang tina, fare dute smat ta dowilna lali Yesus I, ta si mali riri musalana popo, manca be si rlonga I mana. <verse eid="MRK 6:55" /><verse number="56" style="v" sid="MRK 6:56" />Manca be Yesuse nfan mali pnuna, mali bendarna, denabe lalei smatna rari betna, smat ta manana dising smat ta dowilna mali gagaw ta mlelang ta Yesuse bo ndelona. Si rdor lali Yesus i bo npo si oras smat ta dowilna bo dice I, biarega dice ni jubaca cicapona be. Gabe farumi smat ta dowilna rmafia ningalena si dice I.<verse eid="MRK 6:56" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MRK 6" />
  <chapter number="7" style="c" sid="MRK 7" />
  <para style="s">Smat Yahudina rcapial Jou Lahatalla ni parenta ningalena si rderera be fma re bburi tantuba riri fatfatona</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MRK 7:1" />Bahnga laitane, en smat ta rderera fatfato farisi, fare guru agama Yahudina ta rto Musa ni kitab silim tasa, rlafo Yesus mali bendar Yerusalem. <verse eid="MRK 7:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MRK 7:2" />Si dem Yesuse ni muritna rceli ga duase kakamorina ntuba pa rderera fatfato ta hma re bbur tantuba rfafculena. <verse eid="MRK 7:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MRK 7:3" />Ningalena, smat mali fatfato Farisi, laisa smat Yahudi ta nesana, si dicena cicoal agamaca ni fatfatona. Gabe laisa totolange bo tceli, si duase kakamorina rderera hma re bburi tantuba riri sogarona bo Jouca nem tina molang. Gabe laisa duase kakamorina pa, si osta rceli pa. <verse eid="MRK 7:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MRK 7:4" />Laina bena gabe laisa si duwe mali pasar i mali, si rceli pa gabe laisa rfaberesi riri badanca paube ya rderera si riri fatfatona. En bena fatfato nesa ta si dicena cicoal sube, laisa fatfato tuas galas, tampayang fare okosesi ta nesana.<verse eid="MRK 7:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="MRK 7:5" />Gabe smat Yahudi mali fatfato Farisi fare guru agamana rfautno Yesus laitane, “Pesaga Apa nim muritna rderera pa fatfato mali ite hmare re bbur tantubanana? Si rcelina duase kakamorina ntuba pa. Tina molang pa mali Jou Lahatalla nbona!”<verse eid="MRK 7:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="MRK 7:6" />Yesuse nua si, “Ee mew tane smat ta fmadarawa! Ahai ta Jou Lahatalla nua nabi Yesaya ntuba mew to tane ndadi i to, laitane,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MRK 7:6">‘Bangsa tae nfamamagal Ya re fmorina be, ga wlorina laspa mali Ya i.<verse eid="MRK 7:6" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="MRK 7:7" />Ni guna pa rfamamagal Yana, ningalena ta si rfafcule smatnana tina rderera be smatna riri fatfato.’<verse eid="MRK 7:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="MRK 7:8" />Nabi Yesaya nu laina, tina mewe to. Mewe ftafuso pa Jou Lahatalla ni parentana, smatna riri fatfato mewe fderera famafia.” <verse eid="MRK 7:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MRK 7:9" />Yesuse nmauting hawe lali sili, “Mewe fpandena gaole ftaul Jou Lahatalla ni parentana, ningalena mewe fderera be hma re bbu mew tantubana riri fatfato. <verse eid="MRK 7:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MRK 7:10" />Tantuba nabi Musa nparenta laitane, ‘Mewe nane ffamamagal be hma re hye mewna.’ Fare ‘Ise ta nmautingna nu ta mayai lali ni apa i re ni aye, i nane nduk salna nmat.’ <verse eid="MRK 7:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MRK 7:11" />Ga mew fafcule smatna, ahai ta si dailow bo rgali fmarica fare hnyerica, mati si rpona, ga ta mafiana rpeo sadaka lali Jou Lahatalla i. <verse eid="MRK 7:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MRK 7:12" />Mewe fafcule laina, tina laisa re mew fua si mati rgali fmaricana fare hnyericana. <verse eid="MRK 7:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MRK 7:13" />Mewe fafcule ta mfalainana, tina laisa re mewe fderera pa Jou Lahatalla ni parentana, mew fderera be mew nimew fatfato tutuling ta mew ffalafo lali smate nesa. Fare en bena fatfato ta nesana. Fare lal hawe fatfato ta mewe fpei laisa tanena.”<verse eid="MRK 7:13" /></para>
  <para style="s">Mauting ta mayai ta npei denabe smatna ndadi rbaradosa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="MRK 7:14" />Fola tina Yesuse nololaw hawe smat laloca taga nua si laitane, “Flonga famafia bo ftaif ta Ya iku tane. <verse eid="MRK 7:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MRK 7:15" />Ahai ta ncung mali smatna fmorina, tina pa ta npei ndadi i rbaradosa lali Joucana. Ga ta ncapang mali smatna fmorina, tina ta npei denabe i nbaradosa lali Jou Lahatalla i.” [<verse eid="MRK 7:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MRK 7:16" />Gabe, flonga famafia fare fising mali wlomewna.]<verse eid="MRK 7:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="MRK 7:17" />Yesuse I re ni muritna rfateam smat laloca taga rcung mali ebai isa. Fare ni muritna rfautno I andeande ta nanaica ni ngalena.<verse eid="MRK 7:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="MRK 7:18" />Gabe Yesuse nua si, “Ga mewe ma ftaif pa tina ni ngalena? Mewe rasa fto to, ahai ta smatna dan tina npei si rbaradosa pa mali Jou Lahatalla I paga? <verse eid="MRK 7:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MRK 7:19" />Ningalena, an tina ncung namul wlorna pa, ga ncung namul hnyaorna, taga ttopa i natalil mali kakusna.” Yesuse nu laina mali wlonana farumi an na tane ndumi.<verse eid="MRK 7:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="MRK 7:20" />Yesuse nu hawe, “Ga mauting ta ncapang mali smatna fmorina, tina ta npei smatna ndadi rbaradosa. <verse eid="MRK 7:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="MRK 7:21" />Ni ngalena, pumul smatna wlorina, farumi ta mayaina ncapang: fikiran ta mayai, nlokolo smat ta i ni uat i pa penepa ta i ni ngolo i pa, malois, nmafapun, <verse eid="MRK 7:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MRK 7:22" />nyal sal, nlokolo smate nesa ni okosesi, tabeatna mayai, nmafulas mauting, wloya mamagal ni le smat, nfamayai smate ngahnyo, ncombong fare nmakotale. <verse eid="MRK 7:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MRK 7:23" />Farumi ta mayaina tina ncapang mali smatna fmorina, gabe laisa smat cia nderera, tina ta npei i nbaradosa.”<verse eid="MRK 7:23" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesuse n'gali maping isa smat Yahudi i pa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="MRK 7:24" />Gabe Yesus I re ni muritna rfateam gagaw cia, taga rfan lali batang ta ndahle Tirus. Tina to Yesuse ncung namul ebai i, ningalena I nailow pa bo smatna rto I mana. Biarega laina, smatna rto be Yesus I mana. <verse eid="MRK 7:24" /><verse number="25-26" style="v" sid="MRK 7:25-26" />En maping isa, smat Yahudi i pa. I ntub mali batang Siria ndahle bendar Fenisia. I ntu mapingca setane ncungi. Maping cia nlonga Yesuse nlafo, tina to i nfane ga nlu nap mali Yesuse nbona. Fare i ndore bo Yesuse nfaungo setan ta ncunge ntuca.<verse eid="MRK 7:25-26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="MRK 7:27" />Gabe Yesuse nua maping cia, “Ya igali smat Yahudina su. Ningalena gabe laisa Ya igali aw ntuba nuto birahi pa, laisa Ya iyal roti ta rfasadia bo wai nenenana ga ipo lali funna.”<verse eid="MRK 7:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="MRK 7:28" />Fare maping cia nu, “Molang, Apa. Ga fun ta en mali-mali mejaca papapona ma dna ane gleo ta marapawil mali wawai nenenana rari mejaca.”<verse eid="MRK 7:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="MRK 7:29" />Nlonga laina, Yesuse nua maping cia, “Maping ta aw, ta muna molang. Gabe, mfane to! Oras tae setanca ncapange to mali ntumca.”<verse eid="MRK 7:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="MRK 7:30" />Nlonga Yesuse nu fola tina, maping cia nuwe. Nlafo mali ebai i, i neme ntuca namtuli mali baleca popo, ningalena setan cia ncapange to.<verse eid="MRK 7:30" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesuse nfamafia smat isa npongo fare nmomow</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="MRK 7:31" />Fola tina, Yesus I re ni muritna rfateam batang Tirus, rdel mali bendar Sidon. Si rfan mali talaga Galilea mali batang Dekapolis. <verse eid="MRK 7:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="MRK 7:32" />Mana en smat isa, npongo fare nmomow. Smatna dut i lali Yesus i, si rdore bo Yesuse nisinge kakamona mali smat ta nowilca bo nmafia.<verse eid="MRK 7:32" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="MRK 7:33" />Gabe Yesuse nute smatca bo rfalaspa si mali smat laloca bo si smat silu be mana. Fola tina, Yesuse ncunga loboca mali smatca kanyo piluna. Taga Yesuse nitfo I loboca taga nfabasma smat cia papleoca. <verse eid="MRK 7:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="MRK 7:34" />Fola tina, Yesuse nbo nais langitca, nfawana ndasa, fare nu laitane, “Efata!” Efata ta ni ngale, ‘Masalawe to.’ <verse eid="MRK 7:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="MRK 7:35" />Gabe smatca nlonga to hawe, fare i nmautingna molange to.<verse eid="MRK 7:35" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="MRK 7:36" />Fola tina, Yesus nua smat ta manana, mati fafetang I lali smate nesanana. Ga I nua si, “Mdel pa ta bo ffafetngo smatna,” ga si rfacicoulo dafetangna. <verse eid="MRK 7:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="MRK 7:37" />Smat ta rlonga carita tina, si rherang fare rgarayanna gaole, gabe si du, “Farumi ta I npei tina mafiana gaole! I npei smat ta rpongona rlonga hawe, fare smat ta rmomouna rmauting hawe!”<verse eid="MRK 7:37" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MRK 7" />
  <chapter number="8" style="c" sid="MRK 8" />
  <para style="s">Yesuse nfatub smatna lalan fat</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MRK 8:1" />Oras tina, en hawe smatna lal rfayalo si mali Yesus i. Ga si rari anna mnyei to, Yesuse nololawe ni muritna, taga nu laitane, <verse eid="MRK 8:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MRK 8:2" />“Ya ibasamna imasie si smat tane. Wol pitole to si re Yana, taga si rari an na enpanto. <verse eid="MRK 8:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MRK 8:3" />Gabe laisa Ya isula si duwe re hnyaorina lolo pa, mfalaisa gabe rlamhan mali laling popo, si tane rlafo mali pnu ta laspa.”<verse eid="MRK 8:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="MRK 8:4" />Oras ta si rlonga laina, Yesuse ni muritna du laitane, “Guru, gagaw tae nalaspa mali pnu i, mfalaisa ite bo tfatub farumi sina?”<verse eid="MRK 8:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="MRK 8:5" />Yesuse nfautno si, “Mew namew rotina pifis?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MRK 8:5">Si rcanglo, “En pifit.”<verse eid="MRK 8:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="MRK 8:6" />Fare Yesuse ncula smat ta lal tina rtotolang mali nyinyenca. Fola tina, I nyal roti pifit tasa, I nu tarima kase nais Jou Lahatalla i. I nfawogwogla roti tina taga noce ni muritna, taga si rlowto smat laloca. <verse eid="MRK 8:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MRK 8:7" />Mali silina en bena iyan nenena diranca. Yesuse nyal iyan tasa taga nu tarima kase nais Jou Lahatalla i. Fola tina, Yesuse ncula ni muritna rlow to iyanna lali smat laloca. <verse eid="MRK 8:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MRK 8:8" />Gabe farumi si rceli denabe rmosi. Fola tina Yesuse ni muritna rfayalo gleona. Lalona karanjang pifit bakbak. <verse eid="MRK 8:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MRK 8:9" />Smat ta rceli oras ciana, sal pana lalan fat. Rceli fola, Yesuse ncula si farumi duwe. <verse eid="MRK 8:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MRK 8:10" />Gabe Yesuse I re ni muritna tina to dawil pelang, rfan lali batang ta ngahnyo Dalmanuta.<verse eid="MRK 8:10" /></para>
  <para style="s">Smatna rdor fafayal, Yesus I mali Jou Lahatalla i mali</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="MRK 8:11" />Fare smat Yahudi ta rderera fatfato Farisina rlafo bo rfasangsanglo mauting re Yesus bo diyawa Yesuse na sal. Gabe si rdor Yesuse npei mujizat, bo si rto, Yesus cia mali Jou Lahatalla i mali.<verse eid="MRK 8:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="MRK 8:12" />Nlonga tina, Yesuse nfawana ndas falanga taga nu laitane, “Pesaga smat ta rtub oras taena rdor mujizat bo rto Ya mali Jou Lahatalla i mali? Ya ikuwa mew e, Ya osta ifaem mujizat isa pa lali smat ta rtub oras taena.”<verse eid="MRK 8:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="MRK 8:13" />Fare Yesuse nfateam si. I ncapil hawe pelang tasa nfarerer re ni muritna taga rfan lali talagaca pulipao.<verse eid="MRK 8:13" /></para>
  <para style="s">Fpei famafia re smat mali fatfato Farisi fare kolano Herodes ningalena si riri sogarona mayai</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 16:5-12">Mat. 16:5-12</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="MRK 8:14" />Oras ciana, Yesuse ni muritna rtalinga ga dut roti pa. Ta en mali silina, roti pusa i mali pelang i. <verse eid="MRK 8:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MRK 8:15" />Fare Yesuse nua si, “Mew nane fpei famafia re smat Yahudi ta rderera fatfato Farisi rari ragina fare kolano Herodese na ragina.”<verse eid="MRK 8:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="MRK 8:16" />Ga Yesuse ni muritna rtaif pa gabe rfauwo si laitane, “Pesaga Guruca nu lainana ningalena ite rar roti pa.”<verse eid="MRK 8:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="MRK 8:17" />Ga Yesuse nto ahai ta rfauwo si tina, gabe I nua si, “Mewe fu Ya iku lainana, ningalena mewe fut roti pa? Tane, mewe fdela Yana uatu pa! <verse eid="MRK 8:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MRK 8:18" />Mewe mtamewna en, pesaga fem pa ahai ta Ya ipeie tona? Pare, mew ftalinga to? <verse eid="MRK 8:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MRK 8:19" />Mewe nane ftaife to! Ningalena mewe rasa flolam sube oras ta Ya ifawogwogla roti pilim bo ifatube smat lalan limnana. Oras tina, i ni gleona en karajang pifis ta mewe fayalona?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MRK 8:19">Si rcanglo “Karanjang yafasa re pilu?”<verse eid="MRK 8:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="MRK 8:20" />Yesuse nfautno si hawe, “Oras Ya ifatub smat lalan fatnana re roti pifit tasa, ni gleona en karanjang pifis ta mewe ffayalo oras ciana?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MRK 8:20">Si rcanglo, “Karanjang pifit.”<verse eid="MRK 8:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="MRK 8:21" />Gabe Yesuse nua si hawe, “Gabe laina, mewe nane fdela Ya, fare mati wlomewya nsusana re an tina.”<verse eid="MRK 8:21" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesuse nfamafia smat isa nbiaf mali Betsaida</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="MRK 8:22" />Oras Yesuse I re ni muritna rlafo mali Betsaida, en smat sifis dute smat isa nbiaf lali Yesus i. Si rdor lali Yesus i bo nisinge kakamona lali smatca bo smatca nmafia. <verse eid="MRK 8:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MRK 8:23" />Yesuse nice smat ta nbiafca kakamona taga nut i natalil mali pnu cia, bo rfalaspa si mali smat laloca. Fola tina, Yesuse nitfo smat ta nbiafca mtana fare nisinge kakamona mali smat cia. Fare Yesus nfautno I, “Awe meme to?”<verse eid="MRK 8:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="MRK 8:24" />Fare smatca ninga nata fare nu laitane, “Ya ikem smatna rfanfan laisa ai ta nfanna.”<verse eid="MRK 8:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="MRK 8:25" />Yesuse nisinge kakamona hawe lali smat cia mtana, fare smatca nemna ma tutiyai. <verse eid="MRK 8:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MRK 8:26" />Fola tina Yesuse nua smat cia, “Awe muwe to lali nim ebai i, fare mati mlolaina to mali pnu ciana.”<verse eid="MRK 8:26" /></para>
  <para style="s">Petruse nfatuwo Yesuse Mesias</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="MRK 8:27" />Fola tina, Yesus I re ni muritna rfan lali pnu-pnu ta ndahle bendar Kaisarea Filipi. Mali lalingca fapaluan, Yesuse nfautno ni muritna laitane, “Ta mewe flongana, smatna jaga du Ya ise?”<verse eid="MRK 8:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="MRK 8:28" />Si rcanglo, “En ta du Guru cia Yohanes ta nfasisopca, ta nesana du nabi Elia, penepa isa mali nabi ta nesa ta jaga rfalafo Jou Lahatalla ni fatnaw lali smatna.”<verse eid="MRK 8:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="MRK 8:29" />Yesuse nfautno si hawe, “Gabe laisa bo mew, Ya ise?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MRK 8:29">Petruse ncanglo, “Guru cia to Mesias, Kolano ta Jou Lahatalla njaji bo nfasalamate smatna!”<verse eid="MRK 8:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="MRK 8:30" />Gabe Yesuse nua si, “Mdel pa ta bo ffabinga faisana Ya gabe Mesias.”<verse eid="MRK 8:30" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesuse nfabinga ni kangelana fare mfalaisa bo tdadi I ni muritna</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="MRK 8:31" />Mulain mali oras cia, Yesuse nfafcule ni muritna, lomanta Smat ta mali sorogai nane nduk kangela lal, fare simosimo Yahudina dailow I pa, imam ta rfaboboko si na, fare guru agama Yahudi ta rto Musa ni Kitab silim tasa, si bo rpun rfamat I, ga wol pitol I npaling hawe. <verse eid="MRK 8:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="MRK 8:32" />Farumi tina Yesuse nu n'gogan pa. Ga Petruse ndas Yesus mali taona taga ntole I, “Guru, mati mu lainana. Ningalena Aw mkangelana denabe mmat.”<verse eid="MRK 8:32" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="MRK 8:33" />Gabe Yesuse nfulasi ga neme ni muritna fare ntolea Petrus, “Awe mati liomna. Anim mautingna laisa setanna riri kolanoca ni mauting. Ningalena awe mfikir be ta smatna rfikirna, ta Jou Lahatalla nfikirna pa.”<verse eid="MRK 8:33" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="MRK 8:34" />Fare Yesuse nololawe ni muritna fare smat ta lal tina, fare nua si, “Ise ta bo nderera Ya, i nderera i ni mauna pa, i nane nfasadia i denabe nmat ningalena nderera Ya, tina laisa i npapa i ni salipca tutuling bo nderera Ya. <verse eid="MRK 8:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="MRK 8:35" />Ni ngalena ise ga ntubna bo i ni dirica tutuling, i cia nmat osta i re Jou Lahatalla pa denabe lali. Ga ise npo ni tubca ningalena i nderera Ya fare i nfabinga Abar Mafia mali Jou Lahatalla i, i cia ta bo nduk tub re Jou Lahatalla denabe lali. <verse eid="MRK 8:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="MRK 8:36" />Ni ngale pa, gabe smat isa nduke ndumi arata ta mali dunia taena, ga i ntubna i re Jou Lahatalla pa denabe lali. <verse eid="MRK 8:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="MRK 8:37" />Ningalena enpa ta I npona bo nduk tub re Jou Lahatallana denabe lalina.<verse eid="MRK 8:37" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="MRK 8:38" />Smat ta rtub oras taena rmanahan pa rderera Jou Lahatallana. Si rlokolo rpei be dosa. Gabe laisa isa nderera Ya nik sogarona ga nmaya si tina, Ya ma Smat ta mali sorogaica imaya i bo iku, Ya ifayala smat cia oras ta Ya bo ilafo hawe re nik Apa ni kawasa ta mamagalna, farerer re malaikat ta si mali sorogaina.”<verse eid="MRK 8:38" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MRK 8" />
  <chapter number="9" style="c" sid="MRK 9" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MRK 9:1" />Yesuse nua si hawe, “Flonga famafia ta Ya ikua mew tane, mali smate mew fis ta mantanena, en ta osta rmat paube gabe laisa si osta dem paube Jou Lahatalla Nkawasa ndadi Kolano fare I ni kawasa ta mamagalna.”<verse eid="MRK 9:1" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesuse naplanganna gaole puis lolasca</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="MRK 9:2" />Maralapis wol piwonam, Yesuse nut Petrus, Yakobus fare Yohanes si rfarerer rdawil lolas isa tigo. Manana, smate nesana enpa. Si dem Yesuse ni rupana naiwan i ga nesai. <verse eid="MRK 9:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MRK 9:3" />I ni kabayaca ndadi bubulang sasaletam. Mali dunia taena isa pa ta bo npei pake ta bubulang beresi laisa tinana. <verse eid="MRK 9:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MRK 9:4" />Rgarayanna, si dem nabi Elia fare nabi Musa rmauting re Yesus <verse eid="MRK 9:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MRK 9:5" />Petruse nem tina, Petruse nua Yesus, “Guru, amame ksangnangna gaole am mantanena! Gabe ta mafiana amame kfaosal ebai nenena fasitol: Isa bo Guru, isa bo nabi Musa, fare isa fawe bo nabi Elia.” <verse eid="MRK 9:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MRK 9:6" />Petruse nu laina ningalena i nfatoto panto bo nu ahai. Ningalena, smat sitol tasa damcaitna gaole.<verse eid="MRK 9:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="MRK 9:7" />Fare, metna nduri ga ntabak si. Gabe si rlonga mali metna lolo isa lio nu laitane, “Tae Ya ntukca, Ya igogoru i. Flonga i to!”<verse eid="MRK 9:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="MRK 9:8" />Si rgarayan oras ta si rninga lali re mali, deme smate nesa panto manana, motle be Yesuse ntutuling. <verse eid="MRK 9:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MRK 9:9" />Oras, si rduri mali lolas cia, Yesuse nfatnawe si laitane, “Mati fafetngo faisana su ahai ta mewe femnana i na. Lomanta smat ta mali soroga Ica nmate to fare npaling hawe, taga mewe fafetang.” <verse eid="MRK 9:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MRK 9:10" />Gabe si dafetngo isa pa, ga oras ta smat sitol tasa rtutuling, si rfautan lali re mali ni ngale ahai ta Yesuse nu, “Nmate ga npaling hawe tina.”<verse eid="MRK 9:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="MRK 9:11" />Gabe si rfautno Yesus laitane, “Pesaga guru agama ta rto Musa ni kitab silim tasa du, nabi Elia nane nlafo ntuba mali Mesias i, Kolano ta Jou Lahatalla njaji bo nfasalamate smatna?”<verse eid="MRK 9:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="MRK 9:12" />Yesuse nua si laitane, “Ga nabi Elia cia osta nlafo ntuba bo nfasiap farumi. Ga en bena rlefo, Smat ta mali sorogaica osta nkangelana lal fare osta dailow I pa. <verse eid="MRK 9:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MRK 9:13" />Ga flonga famafia ta Ya bo iku tane, smat ta laisa nabi Eliana cia nlafo to, ga smatna rfakangela i rderera si riri mauna, laisa re ta rlefo mali Jou ni Kitabca.”<verse eid="MRK 9:13" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesuse nfaungo setan mali man isa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="MRK 9:14" />Oras ta Yesus Petrus, Yakobus fare Yohanes rlolai lali murit ta nesana, si dem smatna lal rfayalo si mali murit tina. Guru agama Yahudi ta rto Musa ni Kitab silim tasa rfakotale re murit tina. <verse eid="MRK 9:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MRK 9:15" />Smat ta lalna dem Yesus, si rgarayan gabe fatoal be si lali Yesus i.<verse eid="MRK 9:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="MRK 9:16" />Yesuse nfautno si laitane, “Mewe ffakotale ahai re guru agama Yahudi ta rto Musa ni kitab silim tasa?”<verse eid="MRK 9:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="MRK 9:17" />Isa mali smat laloca nu, “Guru, nanai ya ikute ntuk manca lali Awi Guru, ningalena setane ncungi gabe nmomow. <verse eid="MRK 9:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MRK 9:18" />Etnga be setanca ncung i, setanca npesea i nap nyinyenca, denabe bukbukna ncapang mali fmona, fare i fmona lio, taga ni badanca n'ngangala pa. Ya idor fagali mali Guru ni muritna to bo rfaungo setan cia mali ntukca, ga si dafena pa.”<verse eid="MRK 9:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="MRK 9:19" />Gabe Yesuse nua si laitane, “Momofia pa mew smat ta oras taena fdela pa! Opfis hawe Ya nane ifarerer re mewna? Fare denabe opfis hawe Ya nane imanahan re mewna? Futi mali to waica!”<verse eid="MRK 9:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="MRK 9:20" />Fare si dut wawai cia lali Yesus I. Oras ta setanca nem Yesus, taga nfangangala waica denabe sarpesa i nap nyinyenca gabe namolol. Fare bukbukna ncapang mali fmo.<verse eid="MRK 9:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="MRK 9:21" />Fare Yesuse nfautno waica hma, “Popise i be i ndadi laitanena?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MRK 9:21">Waica hma ncanglo, “I mfalaitanena nenena sube. <verse eid="MRK 9:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MRK 9:22" />Ga setanca ma jaga nut waica lali yapna, penepa mali wayana, bo nfamat i. Gabe laisa Guru masie am, mgali ame bo mfamafia i.”<verse eid="MRK 9:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="MRK 9:23" />Ga Yesuse nu laitane, “Awe mati muna, ‘Ya ta ifamafia aw!’ Farumi tina ndadi i gabe smatna rdela Ya!”<verse eid="MRK 9:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="MRK 9:24" />Gabe wai cia hma tina to nuna, nfacicoal i laitane, “Jou ya idela, ga nfalaflafo i pa. Gabe mgali ya bo idelana foloi hawe.”<verse eid="MRK 9:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="MRK 9:25" />Yesuse nem smatna lal mulaine rlafo rfayalo si mali II, gabe I nparentana cicoal lali setan ta ncung wawai cia laitane, “Oi setan ta mpei smatna rmomou fare rpongo. Awe msapang mali wai cia fare mati msungina to!”<verse eid="MRK 9:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="MRK 9:26" />Fare setan cia ncapang, n'gigam fare nfangangala wai cia. Oras setan cia ncapang, waica n'ngangalapa nto hawe, laisa smat ta rmatna. Gabe smat lalo ta si manana du laitane, “Ya, i nmate to!” <verse eid="MRK 9:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="MRK 9:27" />Gabe Yesuse nice waica kakamona fare nfapaling i, fare wai cia npaling tina to nosal.<verse eid="MRK 9:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="MRK 9:28" />Fola tina, Yesus I re ni muritna rcung mali ebai i. Oras Yesus I re ni muritna rtutuling mana, ni muritna rfautno I, “Pesaga amame kafena pa tfaungo setan ciana?”<verse eid="MRK 9:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="MRK 9:29" />Yesuse nua si, “Setan ta mfalainana osta ncapang ga nane tcombayang be.”<verse eid="MRK 9:29" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesuse nfabinga ta failuna I osta nmat</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="MRK 9:30" />Yesuse I re ni muritna rfan mana fare rfaturusa riri fanfanca, rdel mali batang Galilea. Yesuse nailow pa bo smate nesa rto I mana, <verse eid="MRK 9:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="MRK 9:31" />ningalena I nfafcule ni muritna. I nua ni muritna laitane, “Lomanta smat ta mali sorogai bo rpoi lali smatna, fare bo rpun famati, ga bo npaling mali wol ta faicolca.” <verse eid="MRK 9:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="MRK 9:32" />Yesuse ni muritna rtaif pa ahai ta I nu tina, ga si damcait bo rfautno I na.<verse eid="MRK 9:32" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ise ta ncicoal</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="MRK 9:33" />Yesuse I re ni muritna rlafo mali bendar Kapernaum. Oras si rlafo mali ebai i, Yesuse nfautno si, “Nanai oras it mali lalingca fapaluan, mewe fafetang ahai?” <verse eid="MRK 9:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="MRK 9:34" />Farumi si liori pa, ningalena mali lalingca fapaluanna si rfakotale ise ta ndadi smat ta ncicoal mali farumi silina.<verse eid="MRK 9:34" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="MRK 9:35" />Yesuse ntotolang taga nololaw ni murit yafasa re silu tasa, taga nu laitane, “Ise ta nlokolo ndadi smat ta ncicoal mali Jou Lahatalla nbona, i nane ndadi laisa smat ta riri ngale pa mali dunia taena, fare i bena nane ndadi laisa smat ta biasa be ta rleleane farumi smat.”<verse eid="MRK 9:35" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="MRK 9:36" />Fare Yesuse nyal wainena isa taga nfaosal i mali fapalunorina. Yesuse n'gop wai cia, fare nua si laitane, <verse eid="MRK 9:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="MRK 9:37" />“Ise ta nailow smat ta biasa be laisa re wai nenena tae ningalena smat cia ndela Ya, tina laisa re nailow Ya. Fare ise ta nailow Ya bepa, ga i bena nailow Jou Lahatalla ta ncula Ya.”<verse eid="MRK 9:37" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ise ta ni le it pa, smat cia ite rir del i</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="LUK 9:49-50">Luk. 9:49-50</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="MRK 9:38" />Yohanese nfabinga Yesus laitane, “Guru, ame kem smat isa nfaungo setan npake Guru ngahnyomna. Gabe amame ktolea i, ningalena i cia animam del i pa.”<verse eid="MRK 9:38" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="MRK 9:39" />Gabe Yesuse nua si laitane, “Mewe mati ftolea i na! Ningalena, ise npei mujizate ga npake Ya ngahnyokna, osta enpa i nlolaie bo nfamayai ngahnyok nana. <verse eid="MRK 9:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="MRK 9:40" />Ise ta nlawang it pa, i cia ite rir del i. <verse eid="MRK 9:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="MRK 9:41" />Gabe mewe flolam famafia: ise n'gali mew ningalena mewe fderera Kristus, biare ga i noce mew waya galas pusa be, smat ta n'gali mewca osta nduk sagige mulo mali Jouca.”<verse eid="MRK 9:41" /></para>
  <para style="s">Mati fpei smatna bo rdela Ya panto</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 18:6-9">Mat. 18:6-9</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 17:1-2">Luk. 17:1-2</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" sid="MRK 9:42" />Yesuse nua si hawe laitane, “Gabe laisa en smatna rpei denabe smat ta biasa be laisa re wai nena tae gabe ndela Ya panto hawe, ta mafiana pitane smat cia waoca fare tjagta pat mamagal fapusa mali i, taga ftopa i lalaw olatca. <verse eid="MRK 9:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="MRK 9:43" />Gabe laisa kakamomew pao ta pei denabe mew ndadi fbaradosa, fkati to kakamomew tina! Ga ta mafiana mewe fsung soroga re kakamomew pao be, biarega kakamomewna ntotim ga fsung naraka, pumul yap ta nmatmat paca. <verse eid="MRK 9:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="MRK 9:44" />[Mali narakacana, gigoapna nmat pa. Fare ni yapca ma nmat pa.] <verse eid="MRK 9:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="MRK 9:45" />Laina bena, poko be ficomew paona denabe mew ndadi fbaradosa fare fdela Ya panto, ta mafiana fkati to ficomew tina. Ta mafiana tcung sorogana ficor pao be ga ficomewna ntotime ga fsung naraka. <verse eid="MRK 9:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="MRK 9:46" />[Mali narakacana, gigoapna nmat pa. Fare yapna ma nmat pa.] <verse eid="MRK 9:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="MRK 9:47" />Poko be mtamew paona npei mew ndadi fbaradosa denabe ndadi fdela Ya panto hawe, flebateto mtamew tina. Ta mafiana mew fsung mali Jou Lahatalla gagaoca nkawasa ndadi Kolano re mtamew pao be, biarega mtamewna ntotim ga Jou Lahatalla ntopa mew lali narakaca. <verse eid="MRK 9:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="MRK 9:48" />Mali narakacana, gigoapna nmat pa. Fare ni yapca ma nmatmat pa.<verse eid="MRK 9:48" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="49" style="v" sid="MRK 9:49" />Andeande, smatna dising gasi mali dagingna bo biarega tisingna mnu. Laina bena, Jou Lahatalla ntohnga smatna bo si rdela Jouna fatutua fare rmanahan na mnu.<verse eid="MRK 9:49" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="50" style="v" sid="MRK 9:50" />Mew ta fderera Yana nane nimew guna laisa gasina. Gasina ni gunana npei anna ni jame, ga gasi cia ta ndadi namtu, osta enpa o bo tbasam gasi hawena. Laina bena re nimew tub ta mali dunia taena, nane ni guna bo smat ta mali dunia tae fare mewe ma ftubna fautut mafia isa re ta nesana.”<verse eid="MRK 9:50" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MRK 9" />
  <chapter number="10" style="c" sid="MRK 10" />
  <para style="s">Jou Lahatalla npei manca i re ni ngolota ta ndadi pusa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MRK 10:1" />Fola tina, Yesuse nfan lali batang Yudea fare mali batang waya Yordan puli pao. Mana bena smatna lal rlafo rfayalo si mali I. Gabe, Yesuse nfafcule si laisa re ta I peina. <verse eid="MRK 10:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MRK 10:2" />Fare smat Yahudi sifis bena mali fatfato farisi rlafo lali Yesus I bo diyawa I na sal. Si rfautno I laitane, “Gabe bo tderera ite rir agamaca ni fatfatona, bisa pare bisa pa manca rfasawe to ga ntalake ni ngolota?”<verse eid="MRK 10:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="MRK 10:3" />Gabe Yesuse nfautno si laitane, “Mali Joue ni Kitabcana, nabi Musa npo mew parenta ahai?”<verse eid="MRK 10:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="MRK 10:4" />Si du, “Nabi Musa nu manna bisa rtalake riri ngolona ga nane rpei surat talak.”<verse eid="MRK 10:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="MRK 10:5" />Fare Yesuse nua si laitane, “Poko be wlomew ta cicoalna, denabe nabi Musa npei fatfato tina! <verse eid="MRK 10:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MRK 10:6" />Mulain tantuba be Jou Lahatalla npei dunia taena, I npei man re maping. <verse eid="MRK 10:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MRK 10:7" />Gabe, manca osta fateam hma fare hnye taga ntub nfarerer re ni ngolota, <verse eid="MRK 10:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MRK 10:8" />bo smat silu tasa ndadi pusa. Gabe smat silu tasine rtubna rfatutulnge panto, ga si rdadi pusa to. <verse eid="MRK 10:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MRK 10:9" />Gabe tina, ahai ta Jou Lahatalla npei ndadi pusa, smatna bisa panto bo rfatalakna.”<verse eid="MRK 10:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="MRK 10:10" />Nu fola tina, Yesus I re ni muritna rcung mali ebai i. Mana, Yesuse ni muritna rfautno I hawe ga sogaro ta nana i cia.<verse eid="MRK 10:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="MRK 10:11" />Yesuse nua si laitane, “Ise ta ntalake ni ngolota taga nfasaw hawe re mapinge nesa, mali Jou ca nbona i nyal cal mali i ni ngolo ta ntubaca, ningalena i nlokolo re smate nesa ta i ni ngolo i pa. <verse eid="MRK 10:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MRK 10:12" />Laina bena re i ni ngolota. Gabe laisa i ntalake ni uata taga nfasaw hawe re mane nesa, mali Jou ca nbona i ncale to mali ni uat ta ntubaca, ningalena i nlokolo re smat ta i ni uat i pa.”<verse eid="MRK 10:12" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesuse nbarakati wai nenenana</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="MRK 10:13" />Ga smatna dut wai nenena na lali Yesus I bo I nfatige kakamona puis sili taga ncombayang si. Ga ni muritna rtolea smat tina.<verse eid="MRK 10:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="MRK 10:14" />Yesuse nem tina, ntole gabe nua si, “Inanai to wai nenena tina rlafo mali Ya i. Mati ftolea sina, ningalena smat ta rcombong pana fare jampa be rdela laisa re wai nenena tane, si tina ta rpo riri tubca lali Jou Lahatalla i bo I nkawasa ndadi Kolano mali riri tubca. <verse eid="MRK 10:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MRK 10:15" />Wlomewyaneto famafia ta Ya bo ikua mew tane: ise ta nailow Jou Lahatalla laisa re wai nenena ta rcombong pa, i osta ndadi Jou Lahatalla ni smat i ta I bo nkawasa ndadi Kolano mali I ni tubca.”<verse eid="MRK 10:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="MRK 10:16" />Nu fola tina, Yesus n'gop wai nenena tina. Taga nfatige kakamona mali wai nenena taga nbarakati si.<verse eid="MRK 10:16" /></para>
  <para style="s">Smat ta Rkayangna enpa bo ndadi Jou Lahatalla ni smatna</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="MRK 10:17" />Orasna Yesuse bo nfan hawe, en smat isa nfarera be lali Yesus I. Smat cia nlu nap Yesuse nbona taga nfautan, “Guru ta mafiana, ya nane ipei ahai bo iduk tub re Jou Lahatalla dena be lalina?”<verse eid="MRK 10:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="MRK 10:18" />Yesuse nua I, “Smatna isa nmafiya pa, Jou Lahatalla be ta nmafiyana. Pesaga aw mu Ya imafia? <verse eid="MRK 10:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MRK 10:19" />Awe rasa mto to laha, Jou Lahatalla ni parentana: Mate mfapunna mate mnyal sal re smate ni uatna fare smate ni ngolona, mate mloise smatna riri okosesina, mate mdadi saksi ta molang panana, mate mdarawa smatna bo myale riri okosesinana, fare nane masie hmamca fare hyemca!”<verse eid="MRK 10:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="MRK 10:20" />Fare smatca nua Yesus laitane, “Guru, farumi parenta tina ya ipeie ndumi to, mulain mali ta yai wai man sube.”<verse eid="MRK 10:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="MRK 10:21" />Yesuse neme smat cia nbasamna nmasie i, gabe nua i, “Ga motle pusa sube ta aw mpei pau bena. Aw mfane to bo mwage farumi nim aratana taga ni tiwina moce smat ta riri re rari pana. Gabe laisa aw mpei laina, aw osta mduk arata mali sorogai. Fola tina, aw mali bo mderera Ya.”<verse eid="MRK 10:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="MRK 10:22" />Nlonga ta Yesuse nu lainana, smat cia wloyancusa gabe nfan i fare nmagogoru i, ningalena i ni aratana lal.<verse eid="MRK 10:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="MRK 10:23" />Fare Yesuse ningningo I ni muritna mali wela fare balit taga nu laitane, “Eh ncusa i na gaole smat ta ni re naca bo npo ni dirica lali Jou Lahatalla i bo nkawasa ndadi kolano mali i ni tub cana.”<verse eid="MRK 10:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="MRK 10:24" />Nlonga tina, Yesuse ni muritna rherang. Gabe Yesuse nu hawe, “Ya nik deldelo ta igoru sina! Ncusa ina gaole bo rpo riri dirica lali Jou Lahatalla I bo nkawasa ndadi Kolano mali riri tubca. <verse eid="MRK 10:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MRK 10:25" />Mafia sube unta isa ncung ndela mali paplaki mtana ga smat ta ni re naca osta bisa bo npo ni dirica lali Jou Lahatalla i bo ndadi Kolano mali i ni tubcana.”<verse eid="MRK 10:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="MRK 10:26" />Nlonga tina, Yesuse ni muritna nbang i be rherang, gabe fauwo si, “Ali, gabe laina, ise ta bo ncalamatca?”<verse eid="MRK 10:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="MRK 10:27" />Yesuse ningningo si fare nu, “Smatna isa pa ta bo rfasalamate ni diricana. Ga Jou Lahatalla be ta bo nfasalamate smatna, ga Jou Lahatalla ahai be ndadi ndumi.”<verse eid="MRK 10:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="MRK 10:28" />Fare Petruse nu laitane, “It tane tfateame ndumi to ahai ta ite rirna taga tderera Guruca!”<verse eid="MRK 10:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="MRK 10:29" />Yesuse nua si laitane, “Flolam famafia ta ya bo kuwa mew tane. Ise be ta ningalena nderera Ya fare nfabinga Abar Mafia mali Jou Lahatalla I, denabe i nfateame ni ebaica, tenona fare ramana, hnye re hma ntu fare na betna, <verse eid="MRK 10:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MRK 10:30" />i cia mali dunia taena osta bo nduk hawe tutuafe slubisa: ebai, teno re rama, hnye, ntuna fare betna. Ga biarega mfalaina, i osta nduk kangelana lal hawe, ga i lomanta nduk tub re Jou Lahatalla dena be lali. <verse eid="MRK 10:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="MRK 10:31" />Ga smatna lal ta rfoloina mali dunia taena, ga osta rdadi smat ta foloi pa, ga smat ta rfoloi pa mali dunia taena, osta rdadi smat ta foloi.”<verse eid="MRK 10:31" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesuse nfabinga ta faicol I osta nmat</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="MRK 10:32" />Yesuse I re ni muritna rfan lali bendar Yerusalem. Oras ta si rfanna, Yesuse ntuba. I ni muritna wlori yancusa, fare smat ta rderera I nama damcait. Fare Yesuse nololaw ni murit yafasa re silu tasa rdahle I, taga nfabinga si hawe ahai ta bo ndadi i mali I na. <verse eid="MRK 10:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="MRK 10:33" />Yesuse nu laitane, “Flonga e! Oras tae ite bo tfan lali Bendar Yerusalem. Pulina, smatna bo rpo Smat ta mali sorogaica lali imam ta rfabobokona fare guru agama ta rto Musa ni Kitab silim tasa, bo si rfasal Ina denabe nmat. Si bo rpoi lali smat ta Yahudi si pana, <verse eid="MRK 10:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="MRK 10:34" />ga smat tina ta bo rngengeo I, ditfo I fare rpuni rpake wala ta mali cicapona mdalim, fare si rpuni ga nmat. Ga mali wol ta faicolca, I osta npaling hawe.”<verse eid="MRK 10:34" /></para>
  <para style="s">Smat ta rfoloi mali Jou Lahatalla nbona cia smat ta nleleane smate nesa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="MRK 10:35" />Fola tina, Yakobus fare Yohanes, Zebedeuse ntuna, rdahle Yesus taga du laitane, “Guru, en ta amame bo kdorna. Guru mgali am.”<verse eid="MRK 10:35" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="MRK 10:36" />Yesuse nfautno si, “Mewe bo fdor ahai mali Ya i?”<verse eid="MRK 10:36" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="MRK 10:37" />Fare si du laitane, “Lomanta Guru mdadi Kolano fare mkawasa to, ame kdor Guru mnyalam smat am lu tane bo ktotolang mali Guru nim welana fare balitna.”<verse eid="MRK 10:37" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="MRK 10:38" />Yesuse nua si laitane, “Mewe ftaif pa re ahai ta mewe fdorna. Ya tane osta iduk kangelana lal. Ga mewe bisa fpapa kangelana fare sangsara denabe fmat farerer re Ya.”<verse eid="MRK 10:38" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="MRK 10:39" />Gabe si rcanglo, “Amame kailow!”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MRK 10:39">Fare Yesuse nua si, “Mewe ma osta fkangela fare sangsara denabe fmat laisa re Ya. <verse eid="MRK 10:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="MRK 10:40" />Ga ise ta bo ntotolang mali Ya nik wela fare balitna, tina Ya ifato pa. Gagaw cia Ya nik Apa ta nfasadia bo smat ta I nfisange tona.”<verse eid="MRK 10:40" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="MRK 10:41" />Oras ta murit yafasa ta nesana rlonga ahai ta Yakobus i re Yohanese rdorna, si wlorina mayai lali smat silu tasa. <verse eid="MRK 10:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="MRK 10:42" />Fare Yesuse nololaw ndumi si taga nua si laitane, “Mew fto, ta rfaboboko mali bangsa ta rfayala Jou pana, si tina jaga rfaboboko riri rayatna cicoal. Laina bena, si riri smat mamagalna, si jaga rfakangela smat ta rfato sina. <verse eid="MRK 10:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="MRK 10:43" />Ga mewe mate fpei lainana! Ise mali mewi farumi ta flokolo bo ndadi smat ta cicoal foloi mali Jouca nbona, i nane ndadi laisa smat ta biasa be ta bo nleleyane mew. <verse eid="MRK 10:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="MRK 10:44" />Fare ise mali mewi ta bo nlokolo ndadi smat ta cicoal rfoloi mali Jouca nbona, i nane npei ni dirica laisa re smat rkarajan bo nleleyane farumi smat. <verse eid="MRK 10:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="MRK 10:45" />Ningalena smat ta mali sorogaica nlafo mali dunia tae bo tleleyani i pa, gabo nleleyane fare npo ni dirica bo nfayangise smat lalo ni dosa.”<verse eid="MRK 10:45" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesus nfamafia smat ta nbiafca</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="46" style="v" sid="MRK 10:46" />Yesuse I re ni muritna rlafo mali bendar Yerikho. Oras ta si rfan rcapang mali bendar cia, smatna lal ta rderera sina. Mali lalingca lapona en smat isa nbiaf ntotolange ga ndor. Smatca ngahnyo Bartimeus, i hma ngahnyona Timeus. <verse eid="MRK 10:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="MRK 10:47" />Oras ta i nlonga Yesus smat Nasaretca ndel mana, i n'gigam laitane, “Yesus, kolano Daut ni duri, mmasi ya lae!”<verse eid="MRK 10:47" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="48" style="v" sid="MRK 10:48" />Rlonga i n'gigam laina, smatna lal rtolea i. Ga i n'gigamna nfacicoalo nbang, “Apa, kolano Daute ni duri, mmasie ya lae!”<verse eid="MRK 10:48" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="49" style="v" sid="MRK 10:49" />Gabe Yesuse nfola, fare nu laitane, “Fololaw i mali!”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MRK 10:49">Gabe si dua smat ta nbiaf cia, “Msenga to, mosal, Yesuse nololaw aw.”<verse eid="MRK 10:49" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="50" style="v" sid="MRK 10:50" />Nlonga tina, smat ta nbiafca fatoal be ncalawe ni jubaca taga nfan lali Yesus I.<verse eid="MRK 10:50" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="51" style="v" sid="MRK 10:51" />Yesuse nfautno i, “Awe mailowna Ya ipeo aw ahai?” Ga smat ta nbiafca nu, “Guru, Ya idore bo ikem hawe.”<verse eid="MRK 10:51" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="52" style="v" sid="MRK 10:52" />Nlonga tina, Yesuse nua i, “Ningalena mdela Ya to, aw mafia to. Gabe awe mfane to!” Oras cia to, smat ta nbiafca nem hawe, fare i nderera Yesus.<verse eid="MRK 10:52" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MRK 10" />
  <chapter number="11" style="c" sid="MRK 11" />
  <para style="s">Smatna lal ta rtotoman Yesusna oras ta I bo ncung mali Yerusalem</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MRK 11:1" />Oras ta Yesus I re ni muritna rdahle Bendar Yerusalem, taga rlafo mali pnu Betfage fare pnu Betania ta mali popo Zaitun. Manana, Yesuse ncula ni murit silu, <verse eid="MRK 11:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MRK 11:2" />fare nfatnawe laitane, “Mewe ffan lali pnu ta i potaoca. Laisa mewe fsung mana, mewe osta fduk keledai po isa rpitna i mana. Keledai cia smatna rcaplo i paube. Mewe fsalawe wala ta rpitna keledaicana taga fut i mali. <verse eid="MRK 11:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MRK 11:3" />Gabe laisa smatna rfautan, ‘Pesaga mewe fpei lainana,’ me fu laitane, ‘Jouca bo npake keledai tae. Gabe npake fola i to tinato nhawe i mali.’ ”<verse eid="MRK 11:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="MRK 11:4" />Yesuse nu fola laina, smat silu ta rfane ga dem keledai po isa rpitna i mali lalingca lapo. Gabe si rcupat keledai cia ni walaca. <verse eid="MRK 11:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MRK 11:5" />Dem tina, smat sifis ta si manana rtolea si, “Ee, pesaga mewe fsupate keledai cia ni wala cana?”<verse eid="MRK 11:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="MRK 11:6" />Gabe si du laisa re ta Yesuse nfatnawena. Gabe smatna rfabiar si dut keledai cia. <verse eid="MRK 11:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MRK 11:7" />Fare si dut keledai cia lali Yesus i, taga si difa keledai cia puis popona rpake riri jubana. Fare Yesuse ma ndawil keledai cia. <verse eid="MRK 11:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MRK 11:8" />Oras ta Yesus ndel mana, smatna lal riri jubana rpeo ifif mali lalingca. En bena ta rpake ai maglo ta nenena ta wluna po sube, si jal mali beti bo rtotoman Yesus. <verse eid="MRK 11:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MRK 11:9" />Smat ta rfan rdel mali Yesuse nbona fare mali taona, rfamamagal I fare liorina mamagal,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MRK 11:9">“Hosana! Tfamamagal I ta Jou Lahatalla ncula I nlafo mali.<verse eid="MRK 11:9" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="MRK 11:10" />Tfamamagal I tae ta bo ndadi Kolano, laisa re ite hma re bbur tantuba kolano Daut.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MRK 11:10">Hosana! Tfamamagal Jou Lahatalla ta tigo molangca!”<verse eid="MRK 11:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="MRK 11:11" />Rlafo mali Yerusalem, Yesuse nfan lali Ebai Sombayang Mamagalca ni kintalna. Mana I nyel ebaica bo nem farumi ta en manana. Ga bo dorame to, I ncapange ga nfan lali Betania nfarerer re ni murit yafasa re silu tasa.<verse eid="MRK 11:11" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesuse ncasi ai ara ta piyopaca</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="MRK 11:12" />Ni semaca, Yesuse I re ni muritna rfateam pnu Betania. Mali lalingca fapaluan, Yesuse nbasamna nbibisil. <verse eid="MRK 11:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MRK 11:13" />Laspa sube Yesuse nem ai ara isa wluna lal. Yesus nfadahlei bo nem ai ara cia piyo pare en pa. Ga oras Yesuse nlafo mana, I nem ai ara cia piyo pa, wluna be. Ningalena, ni oras paube bo piyona. <verse eid="MRK 11:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="MRK 11:14" />Fare Yesuse nua ai cia, “Awe osta piyomna panto hawe, gabe smatna enpanto ta bo dane piyomna hawena!” Ta Yesuse nuna, ni muritna rlonga bena.<verse eid="MRK 11:14" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesuse nfaungo smat ta rfawage fare rfagon mali Ebai Sombayang Mamagalca ni kintalna</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="MRK 11:15" />Yesuse I re ni muritna rlafo mali Bendar Yerusalem. Fare I ncung mali Ebai Sombayang Mamagalca ni kintalna. Manana smatna rfawage fare rfagon, gabe Yesuse nfaungo si. I nfapalpalna smat ta rfaiwna tiwina fare ta rwage mani pombona riri meja fare bangkona. <verse eid="MRK 11:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MRK 11:16" />I ma nailow pa smatna bo dut ahai be bo rdel mali Ebai Sombayang Mamagalca ni kintalnana. <verse eid="MRK 11:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MRK 11:17" />Taga I nfafcule si laitane, “Mali Jou ni Kitab cana rlefo laitane, ‘Ya nik Ebaica osta ndadi gagaw ta tcombayang bo farumi suku re bangsa.’ Ga mew fpe ina ndadi smat ta rmadarawana riri gagaw i bo rgogan si!”<verse eid="MRK 11:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="MRK 11:18" />Imamna riri ta rfaboboko fare guru agama Yahudi ta rto Musa ni Kitab silim tasa rlonga ta Yesuse npei mali Ebai Sombayang Mamagal ciana, gabe si diyawa lalinge bo rpun famat I. Ga si damcait I, ningalena smat laloca nlokolo nlonga ni sogarona. <verse eid="MRK 11:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MRK 11:19" />Lase bo doram, Yesuse I re ni muritna rcapang hawe mali Bendar Yerusalem.<verse eid="MRK 11:19" /></para>
  <para style="s">Gabe laisa fsombayang fatutua fdelana</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="MRK 11:20" />Ni semaca, Yesus I re ni muritna rfan hawe. Mali lalingca fapaluan, si dem ai ara ta Yesuse ncasi i poyangai cia namange to denabe ni wana. <verse eid="MRK 11:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="MRK 11:21" />Fare Petruse nlolam ahai ta Yesuse nu poyangaina. Gabe nua Yesus laitane, “Guru, co mem! Ai ara ta Guru msasi i cia namang!”<verse eid="MRK 11:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="MRK 11:22" />Gabe Yesuse nua si, “Mewe nane fatutua fdela Jou Lahatalla. <verse eid="MRK 11:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MRK 11:23" />Flonga famafia Ya bo ikuwa mew tane, gabe laisa smatna du lolas tae, ‘Mlange awe bo mdirak awe to lalaw olatca,’ ta i nuna osta ndadi i, ga mali wlona mati nfaututanna ndela, ahai ta i ndorna ndadi i. <verse eid="MRK 11:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="MRK 11:24" />Gabe tina, flolam e, gabe laisa mewe fsombayang lali Jouca, ahai be ta mew fdorna, mewe nane fdela mew osta fduk, fare osta fduk tina. <verse eid="MRK 11:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MRK 11:25" />Gabe mew fosale bo fsombayange ga wlomewna sangnang pa lali smat ta npei sal mali mewi, mewe nane fampunge ntuba isu smat cia, bo nimew Apa ta mali sorogaica ma osta nampunge mew mali nimew dosana.” <verse eid="MRK 11:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MRK 11:26" />Gabe mew fampunge smat ta rpei sal lali mewina pa, ta molangna nimew Apa ta mali sorogaica osta nampunge mew pa.<verse eid="MRK 11:26" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ta rfaboboko agama Yahudina rfautno Yesus mduk kawasa manca mali</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="MRK 11:27" />Yesuse I re ni muritna rlolai hawe lali Bendar Yerusalem. Pulina Yesuse ncung namul Ebai Sombayang Mamagalca ni kintalna, taga nfanfan mana. Oras ciana, imamna riri ta rfabobokona, guru agama Yahudi ta rto Musa ni kitab silim tasa, fare sire simosimo Yahudina rlafo I. <verse eid="MRK 11:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="MRK 11:28" />Si rfautno Yesus laitane, “Farumi ta Awe mpeina, mduk kawasa manca mali? Fare ise ta npo Aw kawasa tina?”<verse eid="MRK 11:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="MRK 11:29" />Gabe Yesuse nua si, “Ya bena bo ifautno mew. Fare mewe fsanglo Ya, taga Ya ifabinga mew ise ta npo Ya kawasa bo ipei farumi tina. <verse eid="MRK 11:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MRK 11:30" />Co mewe fua Ya, ise ta npo kawasa lali Yohanes ta nfasisopca bo ncisope smat nana? Jou Lahatalla pare smatna?”<verse eid="MRK 11:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="MRK 11:31" />Rlonga tinana, si rfauwo si laitane, “Gabe laisa ite tu ‘Jou Lahatalla,’ I osta nua it, ‘Pesaga mew fdela Yohanes pana?’ <verse eid="MRK 11:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="MRK 11:32" />Ga tina osta ite tu, ‘Smatna ta rpo kawasa.’ Amame kamcaite smat lalo tae osta rtole, ningalena si danggap Yohanes tae fatutua nabi ta nfalafo Jou Lahatalla ni fatnaw lali smatna.”<verse eid="MRK 11:32" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="MRK 11:33" />Gabe si dua Yesus, “Amame kkfato to pa!”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MRK 11:33">Gabe Yesuse nua si, “Gabe laina, Ya ma ifabinga mew pa, ise ta npo Ya kawasa ipei farumi tina.”<verse eid="MRK 11:33" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MRK 11" />
  <chapter number="12" style="c" sid="MRK 12" />
  <para style="s">Yesuse npo andeande ga smat Yahudi ta dailow Yesus pana</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MRK 12:1" />Fare Yesuse nmauting hawe lali imamna riri ta rfabobokona, guru agama Yahudi ta rto Musa ni Kitab silim tasa fare simosimo Yahudina. I npake andeande laitane, “En smat isa npei bet anggur taga npei yaya nyel betca. Fare i n'gali lope bo ndadi gagaw bo nfo anggurna. Taga i npei hawe ebai bet isa tigo bo smat ta rjaga bet ciana. Fare i nfane tator re smat ta bo rkarajan mali bet ciana bo rfapepeya i na betca. Fola tina, i nfan lali batange nesa. <verse eid="MRK 12:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MRK 12:2" />Ni oras ta bo tkati anggur na nlafo i, i ncula ni smat karajan isa nfan lali smat ta rjaga bet ciana bo rdore i na lowatna. <verse eid="MRK 12:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MRK 12:3" />Ga si rwagfo smat karajan cia taga rpuni, fare rcula i nuwe nut paisapa. <verse eid="MRK 12:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MRK 12:4" />Fola tina, smat ta na betca ncula smat karajan ta nesana hawe, rfan lali smat ta njaga bet cia. Smat karajan cia ma rpun i denabe bobokoca nmarapes, fare si rfamaimai i. <verse eid="MRK 12:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MRK 12:5" />Fare i ncula i ni smat karajan ta nesana hawe rfan, ga smat karajan cia ma rpun i. Fare lal hawe ta i ncula sina, ga si tina en ta rduk punpun fare en ta rpun si ga rmat. <verse eid="MRK 12:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MRK 12:6" />Oras tae motle smat isa, i ntu ta i n'gogoru ica. Morco napna i ncula ntuca nfan lali sili. I nu laitane, ‘Gabe laisa ya ntukca ta i lali, si osta rlonga i.’<verse eid="MRK 12:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="MRK 12:7" />Ga smat ta rjaga bet ciana rfauwo si laitane, ‘I tae ta bo ndadi waris mali bet taena. Gabe mali bo tpun famat i, bo bet tae ite rar i.’ <verse eid="MRK 12:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MRK 12:8" />Fare rwagfo i ga rpun famat i. Taga ni mayatca rtopa i mali betca potalil.”<verse eid="MRK 12:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="MRK 12:9" />Nafetang fola andeande cia, Yesuse nua si, “Tane, smat ta na betca bo npeo si ahai? I osta nlafo bo npun famat smat ta rjaga bet ciana. Taga betca i npo smate nesa bo rjaga i.<verse eid="MRK 12:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="MRK 12:10" />Mewe rasa fbaca to mali Jou ni Kitabcana ga pat ta rfatailo re Ya nik dirica, ga mewe ftaif pa tina. Laitane ta rlefona,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MRK 12:10">Pat ta basna rtopa ningalena rpake panto, Jou Lahatalla npei ga ndadi pat fandasi ta mafia fare cicoalna gaole.<verse eid="MRK 12:10" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="MRK 12:11" />Jou Lahatalla npei laina, denabe ite temna mafiana gaole.”<verse eid="MRK 12:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="MRK 12:12" />Rlonga tina, ta rfaboboko agama Yahudina ndadi rtaif, smat mayai mali andeande cia, mali Yesuse wlona smat tina. Mana si diyawa lalinge bo rwagfo I, ga si damcait smat laloca gabe rfateam I.<verse eid="MRK 12:12" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ta rfaboboko agama Yahudina rfautan gabe laisa tpalas pajak si bo rfasala Yesuse</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="MRK 12:13" />Fola tina, ta rfaboboko agama Yahudina rcula smat sifis mali ta rderera fatfato Farisina fare smat ta jaga rderera kolano Herodesna, rfane rfautan lali Yesus I bo diyawa I na sal. <verse eid="MRK 12:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="MRK 12:14" />Si rlafo lali Yesus i taga du laitane, “Guru, amame kto guru smat ta mamolang, fare guru miyawa ngahnyom pa. Guru mfafculena molang mfalaisa tub tderera Jou Lahatalla ni mauna, ningalena guru mamcait isa pa. Gabe tane amame bo kfautan, gabe bo tderera ite rir agamaca ni fatfatona, ite tpalas pajak pare enpa lali kolano mamagal Romaca? Ite nane tpalas tina pare enpa?”<verse eid="MRK 12:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="MRK 12:15" />Ga Yesuse nto si wlorina molang pa, Gabe nua si laitane, “Pesaga mewe fiyawa Ya nak salna? Co ffaemo Ya tiwi ta mewe jaga fpake fpalas pajakna.”<verse eid="MRK 12:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="MRK 12:16" />Gabe si rpo. Gabe I nfautno si laitane, “Ise ni gambar i fare ise ngahnyo tane?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MRK 12:16">Si rcanglo, “Kolano mamagal Romaca ni gambar fare ngahnyo.”<verse eid="MRK 12:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="MRK 12:17" />Gabe Yesuse nua si, “Fpo to lali kolanoca ahai ta mewe nane fpo kolanocana, fare fpo to lali Jou Lahatalla i ahai ta mewe nane fpo lali Jou Lahatalla Ina.” Rlonga tina, si rherangna gaole.<verse eid="MRK 12:17" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesuse nfafcule smat ta rmatna osta rpaling hawe</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="MRK 12:18" />En hawe smat sifis mali agama Yahudi ta rderera fatfato Saduki rlafo Yesus. Sadukina riri sogarona, smat ta rmatetona rpaling panto. Gabe si rfautno Yesus laitane, <verse eid="MRK 12:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MRK 12:19" />“Guru, popisei nabi Musa npo parenta, ise be man ta rfasawe tona gabe laisa nmate ga nduke ntu pa, i tenoca nane nfasaw teno ta nmatca ni balo, bo teno ta nmatca ni durina en. <verse eid="MRK 12:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MRK 12:20" />Ga tina ndadi i to laitane: En man smat sifit rfatenow. Ta aban ica nfasawa maping isa ga manca nmat nturi pa. <verse eid="MRK 12:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="MRK 12:21" />Ta failuica ma nfasawa maping cia. I ma namat rduke nturi pa. Laina bena re ta faicol ica. <verse eid="MRK 12:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MRK 12:22" />Laina turus denabe ta suso rano ica nmat rduke nturi pa. Morco napna maping cia nmat. <verse eid="MRK 12:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MRK 12:23" />Gabe, tane amame bo kfautan, lomanta mali wol kiamatca, oras Jouca bo nfapaling hawe smat, ta manca molang smat sifit tasa ta ndadi maping cia ni uat i? Ningalena smat sifit tasa farumi rfasawa i to.”<verse eid="MRK 12:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="MRK 12:24" />Yesuse nua si laitane, “Mewe fsalna gaole, ningalena mewe ftaif Kitabca pa, fare mewe ma fto pa Jou Lahatalla nkawasa. <verse eid="MRK 12:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MRK 12:25" />Ga lomanta Jou Lahatalla nfapaling hawe smat ta rmate tona, si rfasaw panto, ga si rtub farerer re malaikatna mali sorogai.<verse eid="MRK 12:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="MRK 12:26" />Ga smat ta rmate ga rpaling hawena, mew fbaca to carita ta nabi Musa nlefo ica? Oras i mali mom ta ni sogana ga planganna lapo, Jou Lahatalla nua nabi Musa laitane, ‘Ya tane to Jou Lahatalla ta Abraham, Ishak fare Yakub rcuba Ya.’ <verse eid="MRK 12:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="MRK 12:27" />Oras cia, Abraham, Ishak fare Yakub rmate to, ga rpaling hawe rtub farerer re Jou Lahatalla. Gabe, mew smat Saduki tane nimew sogarona ncalna gaole, ningalena Jou Lahatalla smat ta rmatna riri Jou i pa, ga smat ta rtubna riri Jou i.”<verse eid="MRK 12:27" /></para>
  <para style="s">Parenta ta foloi</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 22:34-40">Mat. 22:34-40</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 10:25-28">Luk. 10:25-28</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="MRK 12:28" />Oras tina, guru agama isa ta nto Musa ni Kitab silim tasa nlafo. I ma nto Yesus I re smat ta rderera fatfato Saduki rfasangsanglo mauting nanaina, i nto to ta Yesuse nuna molang, gabe i ndahle Yesus taga nfautan, “Mali farumi Jou Lahatalla ni parenta tina, parenta ta manca ta foloina?”<verse eid="MRK 12:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="MRK 12:29" />Yesuse nua si laitane, “Parenta ta nfoloi cia laitane: Smat Israelna, mew flonga famafia, Jou Lahatalla cia ite rir Jou i, I cia isa be. <verse eid="MRK 12:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MRK 12:30" />Mewe nane fatutua fmasie Jou Lahatalla, mew nimew Jou i. Mew fmasie i na foloi mali farumi ta mewe fmasiena, re ni lalingna flolam I, fare fpo nimew cicoalna bo fpei ta I nailowna. <verse eid="MRK 12:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="MRK 12:31" />Parenta ta failuca laitane, ‘Mewe nane fgogoru smate nesana, laisa re mewe fgogoru nimew dirica tutuling.’ Enpa parenta nesa ta foloi mali parenta silu tasine.”<verse eid="MRK 12:31" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="MRK 12:32" />Fola tina, guru agamaca nua Yesus, “Fatutua to ta Guru mu tina. Jou Lahatalla cia isa be, enpa nto ta nesana ga I be. <verse eid="MRK 12:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="MRK 12:33" />Ite nane fatutua tmasie Jou Lahatalla, ite rir Jou I. Ite nane tmasie I fare ni lalingna wloryaneto I, fare tpo rir cicoalna bo tpei ta I nailowna. Fare it bena nane tmasie smate nesana laisa re ite tmasie rir dirica ntutuling. Farumi tina foloi mali farumi aiwani ta tpo sadaka fare sadaka ta nesana.”<verse eid="MRK 12:33" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="MRK 12:34" />Yesuse nem i ncanglona mafia, gabe Yesuse nuai laitane, “Aw tane msiape bo mdadi Jou Lahatalla ni murit ta I bo nkawasa ndadi Kolano.” Fola tina, smatna isa panto ta bo nfautno Yesus hawena.<verse eid="MRK 12:34" /></para>
  <para style="s">Mesias cia Kolano Daute ni duri i fare i bena kolano Daute ni Jou i</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="MRK 12:35" />Oras ta Yesuse nfafcule smatna mali Ebai Sombayang Mamagalca ni kintalna, I nua laitane, “Guru agama ta rto Musa ni kitab silim tasa jaga rfafcule, Mesias, Kolano ta Jou Lahatalla njaji bo nlafo, I cia kolano Daute ni duri i. Ga Mesias cia ise kolano Daute ni duri i bena? <verse eid="MRK 12:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="MRK 12:36" />Ga oras ta Jou ni Rohca ncung kolano Daut, kolano Daute nfabinga,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MRK 12:36">Jou Lahatalla nua Ya nik Jouca laitane,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MRK 12:36">‘Mtotolange to mali gagaw ta nmafia cia, mali Ya nik welana,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MRK 12:36">denabe Ya ifakala anim musuna ndumi.’<verse eid="MRK 12:36" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="MRK 12:37" />Gabe laisa kolano Daute tutuling be nu Mesias cia i ni Jou i, mfalaisa hawe ite bo tu Mesias cia ga kolano Daute ni duri i?” Ga smat ta lalna rlokolona gaole rlonga ta Yesuse nuna.<verse eid="MRK 12:37" /></para>
  <para style="s">Mati fderera guru agama Yahudi fare smat Farisina riri tabeatnana</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="MRK 12:38" />Yesuse nfabinga si hawe, “Mew nane fpei famafia re guru agama Yahudi ta rto Musa ni kitab silim tasa. Si tina gabe laisa rfanfan, rlokolo rpake juba mlanga bo diyawa be ngahnyori, fare si rlokolo smatna daraga si mali smat lalo nbona. <verse eid="MRK 12:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="MRK 12:39" />Gabe mali ebai sombayangna fare mali ramena, si tina rlokolo rtotolang potao. <verse eid="MRK 12:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="MRK 12:40" />Si ma rlokolo dakal balona taga jale riri ebaina. Fare si le ma gabe rcombayang, riri sombayangna mlanga, naga si bo rfalonga be smat. Si tina osta rduk salna tebteb.”<verse eid="MRK 12:40" /></para>
  <para style="s">Balo ta ni re na paca ni sadaka</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="MRK 12:41" />Fola tina, Yesuse ntotolang nbo kibiya sadakaca taga ntarokira smat ta rtopa riri sadakana. I nem smat ta riri re rarina lal rtopa riri sadakana lalna gaole. <verse eid="MRK 12:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="MRK 12:42" />Yesuse ma ntarokira balo isa ta ncusa nlafo nising ni sadakaca mali sadaka gagao cia. Ga balo cia ni sadaka tasa tiwi sen silu. <verse eid="MRK 12:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="MRK 12:43" />Gabe Yesuse nololawe ni muritna taga nua si laitane, “Flonga famafia e, mali Jou Lahatalla nbona, balo ta ni re na pa tae npona foloi mali farumi smat ta rtopa sadakana mali kibiya sadakaca. <verse eid="MRK 12:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="MRK 12:44" />Ningalena, smat ta riri re rari tane, biarega si rpo tiwina lal, ga si riri tiwina welana lal sube. Ga balo tae, biarega i ni re na pa, i npo ndumi to ni tiwina bo i ni tubca.”<verse eid="MRK 12:44" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MRK 12" />
  <chapter number="13" style="c" sid="MRK 13" />
  <para style="s">Ebai Sombayang Mamagalca bo dewisi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MRK 13:1" />Oras ta Yesuse ncapang mali Ebai Sombayang Mamagalca ni kintalna, I ni murit isa nua Yesus laitane, “Guru, ga gedung tane mafia! Mem pat mamagal ta si rfato tina!”<verse eid="MRK 13:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="MRK 13:2" />Fare Yesuse nua i, “Fatutua, gedung tina mafiana gaole. Ga lomanta ni oras, farumi tina osta rfajakam denabe fasafsafo re nyinyenca, gabe patna pusa bere enpa ta rfato mali gagaonana.”<verse eid="MRK 13:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="MRK 13:3" />Gabe, Yesuse nfan lali popo Zaitun taga ntotolang mali gagaw isa ta nbo lali Ebai Sombayang Mamagalca. Gabe Petrus, Yakobus, Yohanes fare Andreas rdahle Yesus bo si re I be, gabe si rfautno I, <verse eid="MRK 13:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MRK 13:4" />“Guru, mfabinga ame lae, ta Guru mu nanai tina. Opfis Ebai Sombayang Mamagalca bo dewisina. Fare ahai i ni fafayalna gabe laisa farumi tina ndadi i?”<verse eid="MRK 13:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="MRK 13:5" />Yesuse nua si, “Mewe fjagjaga, matina denabe dakale mew. <verse eid="MRK 13:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MRK 13:6" />Ningalena smatna lal osta rlafo rpake Ya ngahnyokna, fare si du laitane, ‘Ya tane to, Kolano ta Jou Lahatalla njaji bo nfasalamate smatna!’ Ga si tina dakale smatna lale to bo rderera si. <verse eid="MRK 13:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MRK 13:7" />Gabe laisa mew flonga parang mali batangna, penepa mali gagaw nesana, mewe mati famcaitna. Farumi tina nane ndadi i, ga tina ni oras paube dunia tae bo nkiamatna. <verse eid="MRK 13:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MRK 13:8" />Ga lomanta suku re suku osta rfaparang, kerajaan fare kerajaan ta nesa osta rfaparang. Fare osta en fawe sui manca-manca, fare en hawe smatna rmata an. Ga farumi tina taga mulain kangela kiamatca nlafo paube, tina laisa kangela ta mapingna rbasam orase nturina ntub.<verse eid="MRK 13:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="MRK 13:9" />Gabe mewe nane fpei famafia! Ningalena mew fdela Ya, smatna bo rpo mew bo dadili mew mali agama Yahudina riri ta rfabobokona. Mew bena bo fduk punpun mali ebai sombayang agama Yahudina. Si rfabo mew lali gubernurca fare kolanona. Fare si bo rfautno mew. Mana mew nimew orase bo fabinga Ya lali sili. <verse eid="MRK 13:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MRK 13:10" />Ningalena farumi suku bangsana nane rlonga su Abar Mafia cia, taga kiamat. <verse eid="MRK 13:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MRK 13:11" />Gabe laisa en ta dute mewe bo dadili mew, mati famcaitna ahai ta bo funa. Mewe fu beto ahai ta Jou ni Rohca ncula funa.<verse eid="MRK 13:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="MRK 13:12" />Osta en ni orasna, smatna rpo tenori fare ramarina bo rduk punpun denabe rmat. Laina bena re apana, si osta rpeo nturina laina. Fare osta en bena wai nenenana rlawage hma re hnyerina, si rpo hma re hnyerina bo rpun famat si. <verse eid="MRK 13:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MRK 13:13" />Gabe farumi smatna osta riri le mew ningalena fderera Ya. Ga smat ta ndela Ya turusca denabe nmat, Jou Lahatalla bo nfasalamat i.”<verse eid="MRK 13:13" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesuse nfabinga ta bo ndadi mali wol ta kangelana</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="MRK 13:14" />Yesuse nu, “Lomanta en smat isa nmakotalena gaole mali Jou Lahatalla, i bo nlafo. Smat cia bo nosal mali Ebai Sombayang Mamagalca, mali gagaw ta pantasa pa bo ina. (Ise ta nbaca tane, ftarokira famafia bo ftaife ningalena). Gabe laisa smat ta nmakotaleca nosal mana to, smat ta en mali batang Yudeana, ta mafiana rfarera bo fgogane mew mali lolasna. <verse eid="MRK 13:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MRK 13:15" />Smat ta si puis ebaina popo, mati fduri bo fyal okosesi mali ebai lolona, ga fduri fare ffarera to. <verse eid="MRK 13:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MRK 13:16" />Laina bena re smat ta en mali betina, mati flolai mali ebai i bo fyal pakena. Fatoale bo ffarera! <verse eid="MRK 13:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MRK 13:17" />Ga ta rkangela foloi oras ciana, maping ta riri badanna fare ta nturina ncus subena.<verse eid="MRK 13:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="MRK 13:18" />Fsombayange to bo tina mati ndadi ina mali wol ta orasna ulan. <verse eid="MRK 13:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MRK 13:19" />Ningalena, wol tina kangelana gaole, foloi fawe mali kangela ta smatna rbasame to. Mulain mali ta Jou Lahatalla npei dunia taena denabe oras tae, enpanto kangela ta bo ndadi i laisa tinana, fare tina osta ndadi i panto. <verse eid="MRK 13:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MRK 13:20" />Gabe laisa Jouca nfakokope wol ta nkangela cia, smatna osta rmate ndumi. Ga ningalena I n'gogoru smat ta I fisange tona, I nfakokope wol kangela cia.<verse eid="MRK 13:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="MRK 13:21" />Oras tina, gabe laisa en smatna dua mew, ‘Co fem! Mesias I mantane!’ Penepa si du, ‘Mesias I pulina!’ Mew mati fdelana ahai ta si du tina. <verse eid="MRK 13:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MRK 13:22" />Ga lomanta en smatna lal rlafo du si Mesias, penepa du si nabi ta jaga rfalafo Jou Lahatalla ni fatnaw lali smatna. Fare si bena rpei mujizat fare fafayal ta nfafcule si riri kawasa bo smatna rdela si bo si mati rdela Jou Lahatallana to. Gabe laina, si le ma bo rpei smat ta Jou Lahatalla nfisang si tona rdele ncal laling. <verse eid="MRK 13:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MRK 13:23" />Gabe, mewe nane fpei famafia to! Farumi tina Ya ikua mewe ntuba to tina ndadi paube.”<verse eid="MRK 13:23" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesuse bo nlafo hawena ni fafayal</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="MRK 13:24" />Yesuse nu hawe, “Oras wol kangelaca bo morco, wolca fare ngaca plangno panto hawe. <verse eid="MRK 13:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MRK 13:25" />Ototafna osta marapawil mali langitca, gabe farumi ta en mali langitcana ndadi rurang.<verse eid="MRK 13:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="MRK 13:26" />Ga oras cia, smatna osta demi Smat ta mali sorogaica nlafo nfarerer re metna fare farumi ni kawasa ta mamagalna. <verse eid="MRK 13:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="MRK 13:27" />Gabe, smat ta mali sorogaica osta ncula malaikatna rfayalo farumi I ni smat ta I nfisange tona mali farumi gagaw mali dunia tae, mali cicapo denabe lali cicapo.”<verse eid="MRK 13:27" /></para>
  <para style="s">Wol-wol ta kangelana ndadi fafayal Yesus bo nlafo hawe</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 24:32-35">Mat. 24:32-35</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 21:29-33">Luk. 21:29-33</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="MRK 13:28" />Yesuse nu andeande isa laitane, “Coba mewe fbalajar mali ai ara tae. Gabe laisa ni magal nenenana, mulaine bisbis fare mulaine ntipa i, mewe fto wolwolna bo nlafo i to. <verse eid="MRK 13:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="MRK 13:29" />Laina bena gabe laisa mew fem wol ta kangelana ta Ya ikuna mulaine bo ndadi i to, mew ndadi fto, mnu panto hawe smat ta mali sorogaica bo nlafo hawe. <verse eid="MRK 13:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MRK 13:30" />Flonga famafia ta Ya ikuwa mew tane, smat ta rtub oras taena en ta rtub sube denabe farumi tina ndadi i. <verse eid="MRK 13:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="MRK 13:31" />Langit fare bumi tae bo namnyei, ga Ya nik mautingna osta en turus denabe lali.”<verse eid="MRK 13:31" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="MRK 13:32" />Gabe Yesuse nua ni muritna hawe, “Isa ntopa opfis Jou Lahatalla ntuca nlafo hawena. Malaikat ta mali soroga ina rtopa, Jou Lahata ntu cama ntopa, ga Jou Lahatalla be ta ntona. <verse eid="MRK 13:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="MRK 13:33" />Gabe mewe nane fpei famafia fare fjagjaga! Ningalena, mew ftopa opfis tina bo ndadi ina. <verse eid="MRK 13:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="MRK 13:34" />Oras ta Smat ta mali sorogaica bo nlafo hawe, Ya ipo andeande laisa ebai ppu isa nfateame ni ebaica, ningalena i bo nfana lali gagaw ta laspa.I nfn paubena, i nua ni smat karajanna rjaga ni ebaica, fare i nlowto si karajan isa-isa. I ma nua ta njaga manaca bo njaga turus. <verse eid="MRK 13:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="MRK 13:35" />I nane njagjaga to, ningalena i ntopa ebai ppuca opfise bo nlafona. Faramanega i nlafona malingine lae, doram wop fapaluane lae potamdoma penepa dororam isube. Laina bena re mew. Mewe nane fjagjaga turus. <verse eid="MRK 13:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="MRK 13:36" />Matina denabe Ya ilafo ga ikeme mew fsiap pa. <verse eid="MRK 13:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="MRK 13:37" />Ahai ta Ya ifatnawe mewna, Ya ifatnawe bena mali farumi smat: fjagjaga to!”<verse eid="MRK 13:37" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MRK 13" />
  <chapter number="14" style="c" sid="MRK 14" />
  <para style="s">Ta rfaboboko agama Yahudina rfatatore bo rpun famat Yesus</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MRK 14:1" />Motle wol pilu be smat agama Yahudina bo rpei riri wol mamagal ta ngahnyo Paska. Wol mamagal cia, si rlolam ta Jou Lahatalla nfabebase hma re bburi tantubana mali smat Mesir ta rfakangela sina, fare si bena rpei wol mamagal Roti ta npake Ragi Pa. Ga oras ciana, smat Yahudina riri imam ta rfaboboko fare guru agama ta rto Musa ni Kitab silim tasa rfatator re bo rwagfo Yesus ni lalingna rgogogan si bo rpun famati. <verse eid="MRK 14:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MRK 14:2" />Si rfauwo si, “Mati twagfo i mali wol mamagal taena, matina denabe smat ta rlokolo i na rpei hal.”<verse eid="MRK 14:2" /></para>
  <para style="s">Maping isa nbaradosa nduplo egat pau mafia mali Yesus i</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="MRK 14:3" />Oras Yesus i mali pnu Betania, I ntuli mali Simone ni ebaica. Simon tae popiseina panyaket pado. Oras Yesuse ntotolange ga nceli, maping isa nlafo nut egat pau mafia ta ngahnyo narawastu, mulona mamagal mali botol pat bubulang isa. Maping cia ncalawe egat gagao sapngoca, fare nduplo falalalo i mali Yesuse bobokoca.<verse eid="MRK 14:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="MRK 14:4" />Ga smat sifis ta dem tina, rcangnang pa gabe rfauwo si, “Egat pau mafiaca mulona mamagal pesaga nfable i na? <verse eid="MRK 14:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MRK 14:5" />Gabe laisa twage i, mulona laisa re smat ta rkarajanna rari sagige mulo taun bahnga. Ga tiwi tina tlouto smat ta riri re rari pana.” Fare si rtolea maping cia.<verse eid="MRK 14:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="MRK 14:6" />Dem tina, Yesuse nua smatna, “Pesaga mew ftolea maping taena? Inanai to. I npei okosesi ta mafia mali Ya i. <verse eid="MRK 14:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MRK 14:7" />Smat ta riri re rari pana osta si mali mewi turus, gabe oras ahai be mew musti fgali si. Ga Ya tanei farerer re mew turus pa. <verse eid="MRK 14:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MRK 14:8" />Maping tae npeie to ahai ta i musti npeina. I nduplo egat pau mafia mali Ya nik badan tae, tina laisa re i nfasiape to Ya nik mayatca oras ta bo rgaile Yana. <verse eid="MRK 14:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MRK 14:9" />Flolam famafia ta Ya iku tane, manca be smatna rfabinga Abar Mafia mali Jou Lahatalla i mali farumi dunia tae, si osta dafetang ahai ta maping tae npeo Yana denabe smatna osta rlolam i.”<verse eid="MRK 14:9" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yudase nfatatore bo npo Yesus</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="MRK 14:10" />Isa mali Yesuse ni murit yafasa re silu tasa, i ngahnyo Yudas Iskariot. I nfan lali imamna riri ta rfabobokona bo nfabinga si, i bo npo Yesus lali sili. <verse eid="MRK 14:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MRK 14:11" />Oras ta si rlonga Yudase ni mauting tina, si rcangnang gabe si rjaji bo doce i tiwi. Fola tina, Yudase niyawa oras ta mafia bo npo Yesus lali sili.<verse eid="MRK 14:11" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesuse nceli farerer re ni muritna mali wol mamagal Paskaca</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="MRK 14:12" />Mali wol ta pusa ica oras si rpei wol mamagal Roti ta npake Ragi Pa, oras ciana si nane rkati domba Paska. Gabe Yesuse ni muritna rlafo I ga rfautan, “Guru, manca Guru mailowna amame kfasadia an wol mamagal Paska bo ite tceli farerer?”<verse eid="MRK 14:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="MRK 14:13" />Rlonga tina, Yesuse ncula ni murit silu. I nu laitane, “Mew lali Bendar Yerusalem, pulina mew osta faduduk re man isa npapa tampayang isa lolo waya. Mewe fderera i. <verse eid="MRK 14:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="MRK 14:14" />Flafo mali ebai ta i ncungica, mewe fua ebai ppuca, ‘Animam Guruca ncula kfautan, manca gagaw ta Guruca bo npake i nceli wol mamagal Paska farerer re I ni muritna?’ <verse eid="MRK 14:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MRK 14:15" />Mana ebai ppuca osta nfafcule mew gagaw isa ta nmamagal puis paona fare farumi parkakasna en mana ndumi to. Mewe fasadia to an wol mamagal cia mana.”<verse eid="MRK 14:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="MRK 14:16" />Rlonga Yesuse nu fola tina, I ni murit silu rfan. Rlafo mali bendar cia, si rduk laisa re ta Yesuse nua sina. Fare si rfasadia an wol mamagal Paska.<verse eid="MRK 14:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="MRK 14:17" />Orasna doram, Yesuse nlafo mali gagaw cia nfarerer re I ni murit yafasa re silu tasa. <verse eid="MRK 14:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MRK 14:18" />Oras ta si rtotolange ga rceli, Yesuse nu laitane, “Flolam famafia ta Ya iku tane. Mali mewi ta ftotolange ga fseli re Ya tane, en smat isa ta bo nwage Ya.”<verse eid="MRK 14:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="MRK 14:19" />Rlonga tina, si wlorina nmagogoru i gabe isa-isa dua I, “Ya pa, paga?”<verse eid="MRK 14:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="MRK 14:20" />Fare Yesuse nua si “Smat cia isa mali mew smat yafasa re silu tane, i ta ntuke roti galas isa re Ya. <verse eid="MRK 14:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="MRK 14:21" />Ga Smat ta mali Sorogaica osta nmat laisa re ta Jou Lahatalla nu ntuba tona. Nabina rlefo laina to mali Jou ni Kitabca. Ga nkapalange to smat ta nwage smat ta mali sorogaicana, i osta nduk salna tebteb. Smat cia ta mafiana mati ntub mali dunia taena.”<verse eid="MRK 14:21" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesus nceli farerer re ni muritna</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 26:26-30">Mat. 26:26-30</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 22:14-20">Luk. 22:14-20</ref>; <ref loc="1CO 11:23-25">1Kor. 11:23-25</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="MRK 14:22" />Oras Yesus I re ni muritna rceli, Yesuse nyal roti taga ndor tarima kase nais Jou Lahatalla I. Fola tina, I nfawogwogla roti tina taga noce si, I nu, “Roti tane Ya nik badanca, fyale to.”<verse eid="MRK 14:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="MRK 14:23" />Fola tina, I nyal cawan taga nu tarima kase nais Jou Lahatalla I. Fare I noce si gabe farumi rdom mali cawan cia. <verse eid="MRK 14:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="MRK 14:24" />I nua si, “Tane Ya nik laflafna. Oras Ya imat, Ya nik laflafna osta maraepa bo faolang Jou Lahatalla ni janji lali smatnana. Ga Ya nik laflafna maraepa bo nfayangise smat lalo ni dosana. <verse eid="MRK 14:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MRK 14:25" />Flonga famafia ta Ya bo iku tane, mantane bo lali, Ya osta idom anggur panto. Lomanta Jou Lahatalla nkawasa ndadi Kolano mali I ni smatna, taga Ya idom hawe anggur ta pona.”<verse eid="MRK 14:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="MRK 14:26" />Fola tina, Yesus I re ni muritna rmanyanyi nyanyian bo Jou Lahatalla, folana si rfan lali popo zaitun.<verse eid="MRK 14:26" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesuse nfabinga ntuba to Petruse nu osta nfayala Yesus pa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="MRK 14:27" />Fare Yesuse nua si, “Farumi mew ta fdela Yana osta fngangala denabe ffarera fateam Ya. Ningalena, Jou Lahatalla nu to mali ni Kitabca laitane, ‘Ya osta ipun smat ta rjaga dombana, gabe domba ta rjagana rfasaksake si lali re mali.’<verse eid="MRK 14:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="MRK 14:28" />Tina ningalena, Ya osta imat, ga oras Ya osta ipaling hawe, Ya osta ilafo ntuba mali mewi mali batang Galilea bo ite tfaduduk pulina.”<verse eid="MRK 14:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="MRK 14:29" />Fare Petruse nua Yesus, “Biarega farumi si riri ta rdelana ngangala denabe ffarera fateam Guru, ya osta enpa.”<verse eid="MRK 14:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="MRK 14:30" />Fare Yesuse nua i, “Mlonga famafia ta Ya bo ikua aw tane, doram tae to, failu paube tataleca nkuku awe osta mu mfayala Ya pana faicol.”<verse eid="MRK 14:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="MRK 14:31" />Ga Petruse ncanglo i nu laitane, “Gabe laisa Guru mmat, ya bena osta imat, ga ya osta iku pa ifayala Guru pana.” Ga Yesuse ni murit ta nesana ma du laina.<verse eid="MRK 14:31" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesuse ncombayang mali bet Getsemani</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="MRK 14:32" />Fola tina, Yesuse I re ni muritna rfan lali gagaw isa ta ngahnyo Getsemani. Fare Yesuse nua si, “Mewe ftotolang mantane su e, Ya bo isombayang. <verse eid="MRK 14:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="MRK 14:33" />I nut Petrus, Yakobus fare Yohanes. Oras ciana, I nbasamna namcaitna gaole fare namderer. <verse eid="MRK 14:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="MRK 14:34" />Gabe I nua smat si tol tasa, “Ya wlok yancusana gaole, ibasamna laisa bo imatna. Mew mantane su e, fare fjagjaga.”<verse eid="MRK 14:34" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="MRK 14:35" />Fola tina, Yesuse nfan lali faokoce, fare nlu nap denabe uhngoca neta nyinyenca, taga ncombayang. I ndor gabe laisa bisa, I mati nduk kangela ta Jou Lahatalla nu to bo I na. <verse eid="MRK 14:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="MRK 14:36" />I nu laitane, “Apa e, ya Apa, Ya ito farumi Apa bisa mpei, enpa ta Apa bisa mpeipana. Gabe Ya idor Apa mfalaspa farumi kangela tane mali Ya i, ga mati mderera Ya nik maunana, mderera be Apa nim mauna.”<verse eid="MRK 14:36" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="MRK 14:37" />Yesuse ncombayange fola, nlolai hawe lali sili, ga I nem sina smat sitol tasa damtoal. Gabe nfapaling si fare nua Petrus, “Simon, aw mamtuli? Awe mafena pa bo mtotoman jam habanga be bo mjagjagana? <verse eid="MRK 14:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="MRK 14:38" />Fjagjaga fare sombayange to, bo mew mati fmarapaolo dosacana, ningalena biarega mew wlomewna floko fderera Ya, ga nimew badanca nmampo pa.”<verse eid="MRK 14:38" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="MRK 14:39" />Fola tina, I nfan hawe ga ncombayang, ndor laisa ta nana i na hawe <verse eid="MRK 14:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="MRK 14:40" />Ncombayange fola, nlolai hawe lali smat sitol tasa, I nem sina damtoal hawe, ningalena si damtututilna gaole. Si rpaling, si rfatoto pa bo dua Yesus ahai.<verse eid="MRK 14:40" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="MRK 14:41" />Fola tina, I nfane ncombayang hawe ta faicol. Ga I nlolai lali sili, I nua si, “Mewe famtuli fare fafolfola mew hawe? Nlafo i to. Tane ni orasna nlafo i to. Co mewe fem, Smat ta mali Sorogaica bo rpoi lali smat ta rbaradosana. <verse eid="MRK 14:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="MRK 14:42" />Fosale to bo tfan. Smat ta bo nwage Yaca nalaw panto.”<verse eid="MRK 14:42" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesuse rwagfo I</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" sid="MRK 14:43" />Oras Yesuse nmauting sube, garayanna isa mali Yesuse ni murit yafasa re silu tasa ta ngahnyo Yudasca nlafo. I nlafo farerer re smatna lal, en ta dut eta fare en bena ta dut ai motmoto. Smat tane imamna riri ta rfabobokona, guru agama Yahudi ta rto Musa ni Kitab silim tasa fare simosimo Yahudina. <verse eid="MRK 14:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="MRK 14:44" />Yudas ta nwage Yesusca npei fafayale to lali smat lalo ciana, i nu laitane, “Smat ta fola ya bo ifatan i cia, cia to ta mew nane fwagfo ica. Mewe fwagfo i fare futi, matina denabe I nfarera.”<verse eid="MRK 14:44" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" sid="MRK 14:45" />Gabe smat laloca nlafo mana, Yudase tina to ndahle Yesus taga nu, “Guru,” fare nfatan Yesus <verse eid="MRK 14:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="MRK 14:46" />Gabe smat ta rlafo farerer re Yudasna rfadahle si, rwagfo Yesus. <verse eid="MRK 14:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="MRK 14:47" />Ga smat isa ta nfarerer re Yesus mana, i ncalawe ni etaca taga nkati imam mamagalca ni smat karajan isa kanyona denabe morit.<verse eid="MRK 14:47" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="48" style="v" sid="MRK 14:48" />Fare Yesuse nua si, “Mewe fu rasa Ya tane smat mayai ya, denabe mew flafo fut eta fare ai motmoto bo fwagfo Ya? <verse eid="MRK 14:48" /><verse number="49" style="v" sid="MRK 14:49" />Naga wol de wol Ya re mew oras ta Ya ifabinga Jou Lahatalla ni Abar Mafia mali Ebai Sombayang Mamagalca. Pesaga mew fwagfo Ya mana pana? Ga laina to, tina nane ndadi i, ningalena farumi tina rlefoe to mali Jou ni Kitabca.”<verse eid="MRK 14:49" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="50" style="v" sid="MRK 14:50" />Far e Yesuse ni muritna farumi rfarera rfateam I.<verse eid="MRK 14:50" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="51" style="v" sid="MRK 14:51" />Manana waiman isa ntutup i re obat ndederera Yesus, ga si bo rwagfo i. <verse eid="MRK 14:51" /><verse number="52" style="v" sid="MRK 14:52" />Ga waimanca nowe ni obatna ga nfarera wangat bakbako i.<verse eid="MRK 14:52" /></para>
  <para style="s">Mahkama Agamana durus Yesus</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="53" style="v" sid="MRK 14:53" />Fola tina, si dut Yesus rfan lali imam mamagal ni ebaica. Mana, farumi imam ta rfabobokona, simosimo Yahudina fare guru agama ta rto Musa ni Kitab silim tasa, si rfayalo si mana. <verse eid="MRK 14:53" /><verse number="54" style="v" sid="MRK 14:54" />Oras Yesus duti mana, Petruse nderera i ga nalaspa, denabe rlafo mali imam mamagalca ni kintal ebaica, rlafo rtotolang rdahle yapca taga rnana si farerer re ta rjaga manana.<verse eid="MRK 14:54" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="55" style="v" sid="MRK 14:55" />Mana, imam ta rfabobokona fare farumi ta rfaboboko Mahkama Agama si diyawa smate bo rcaksi ta molang pa bo ndadi fafayal Yesuse ncal, bo rfasal Ina nmat. Ga si rduk pa. <verse eid="MRK 14:55" /><verse number="56" style="v" sid="MRK 14:56" />Smatna lal ta rlafo rdadi saksi ta molang pa ga ta si rfabingana nfaiteta i pa isa re ta nesana.<verse eid="MRK 14:56" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="57" style="v" sid="MRK 14:57" />En smat sifis ta dosal mana rfabingana molang pa, si du, <verse eid="MRK 14:57" /><verse number="58" style="v" sid="MRK 14:58" />“Ame klonga smat tae bahngana nu, I osta npu Ebai Sombayang Mamagal ta smatna rfaosal ica, ga mali wol pitul I osta nfaosal ta nesana, ta smatna rpei pana.” <verse eid="MRK 14:58" /><verse number="59" style="v" sid="MRK 14:59" />Ga farumi ta si rfabingana nfaiteta i pa isa fare ta nesana.<verse eid="MRK 14:59" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="60" style="v" sid="MRK 14:60" />Fola tina, imam mamagalca nosal mali Mahkama Agama ta rfayalo sina fapaluan, taga nfautno Yesus, “Smatna lale to ta du Aw sal, ga Aw msanglo pa?”<verse eid="MRK 14:60" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="61" style="v" sid="MRK 14:61" />Ga Yesuse lio pa, I nu paisapa. Gabe imam mamagalca nfautno I hawe, “Apa fatutua Aw tane Mesias, Kolano ta Jou Lahatalla njaji tantuba be? Fare fatutua Aw tane ma Jou Lahatalla ta ite tfamamagal I ca Ntu Aw?”<verse eid="MRK 14:61" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="62" style="v" sid="MRK 14:62" />Fare Yesuse ncanglo, “Fatutua, I cia Ya to. Mew osta fem Smat ta Mali Sorogaica ntotolang mali gagaw ta nmafiaca mali Jou Lahatalla ta nkawasa ni welana, ga bo nlafo mali langitca mali metna fapaluan.”<verse eid="MRK 14:62" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="63" style="v" sid="MRK 14:63" />Rlonga Yesuse nu laina, imam mamagalca ntolena gaole denabe ncekane ni jubaca taga nu laitane, “Ga, smat tae npei ni dirica laisa Jou Lahatalla! <verse eid="MRK 14:63" /><verse number="64" style="v" sid="MRK 14:64" />Gabe ite mati tiyawa saksina to! Mew tutuling flonga, to? Oras tae gabe laisa bo mew mfalaisa?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MRK 14:64">Fare farumi ta si mali Mahkama Agama tina dailow, Yesuse nduk salna nmat.<verse eid="MRK 14:64" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="65" style="v" sid="MRK 14:65" />Fare smat sifis mali silina, sina taga ditfo Yesus. Si rpitane mtana rpake obat, taga si rpun I, taga rfautan, “Gabe Aw fatutua smat ta mut Jou Lahatalla ni fatnaw, co Awe mu, ise ta npunna Aw!” Ta rjaga manana ma rpun I.<verse eid="MRK 14:65" /></para>
  <para style="s">Petruse nu nfayala Yesus pa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="66" style="v" sid="MRK 14:66" />Oras ciana, Petruse i mali imam mamagalca ni kintal ebaica, gabe imam mamagalca ni smat karajan maping isa nlafo. <verse eid="MRK 14:66" /><verse number="67" style="v" sid="MRK 14:67" />Fare oras ciana mapingca nem Petruse nnana i mana, i natngalo Petruse uhngoca taga nu laitane, “Aw bena jaga mfarerer re Yesus, smat Nasaret cia paga?”<verse eid="MRK 14:67" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="68" style="v" sid="MRK 14:68" />Ga Petruse nu enpa, nu nfayala Yesus pa. I nu laitane, “Ya itaif pa ta amuna.” Fola tina, Petruse i lali pasebaica taga nfatengtengan i mana. [Oras cia to, tataleca nkuku.]<verse eid="MRK 14:68" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="69" style="v" sid="MRK 14:69" />Mana, smat karajan mapingca nem Petrus hawe, gabe i nua smat ta si manana, “Smat taema jaga nfarerer re Yesus.” <verse eid="MRK 14:69" /><verse number="70" style="v" sid="MRK 14:70" />Ga Petruse npida hawe.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MRK 14:70">Mnu pana, smat ta si manana dua hawe Petrus, “Ncal panto, awe isa mali sili paga? Taga aw tane smat Galilea aw!”<verse eid="MRK 14:70" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="71" style="v" sid="MRK 14:71" />Fare Petruse mulaine ncasi, “Sobe Ya re Jou, ya ifayala I pa smat ta mewe fu i tae!”<verse eid="MRK 14:71" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="72" style="v" sid="MRK 14:72" />Ga oras cia to, tina to tataleca nkuku ta failu. Mana Petruse mulaine wloyaneto ta Yesuse nua ina laitane, paube tataleca nkuku failuna, aw mu nfayala Ya pana faicole to.”<verse eid="MRK 14:72" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MRK 14" />
  <chapter number="15" style="c" sid="MRK 15" />
  <para style="s">Yesuse durus I mali Gubernurca</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MRK 15:1" />Orasna dororami sube, imamna riri ta rfaboboko rfayalo si hawe fare simosimo Yahudi, guru agama Yahudi ta rto Musa ni kitab silim tasa, fare farumi Mahkama Agamana riri wawai ta manana, si jal faorit. Gabe si rpitan Yesus taga dut i, taga rpoi lali Pilatus i bo nfasalina denabe nmat.<verse eid="MRK 15:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="MRK 15:2" />Rlafo puli tina, Pilatuse nfautno Yesus, “Fatutua Apa smat Yahudina riri Kolano Aw?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MRK 15:2">Yesuse ncanglo, “Apa tutuling ta mu laina.”<verse eid="MRK 15:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="MRK 15:3" />Imamna riri ta rfabobokona du Yesuse, lale to npei okosesi ta tamayaina.<verse eid="MRK 15:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="MRK 15:4" />Pilatuse nfautno I hawe laitane, “Mlonga tina! Si du to Apa mpei okosesi ta mayaina lale to. Pesaga Apa mgali nim dirica pana?”<verse eid="MRK 15:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="MRK 15:5" />Ga Yesuse lio pa, denabe gubernur Pilatuse nherang.<verse eid="MRK 15:5" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesuse nduk salna nmat</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="MRK 15:6" />Etnga be taun, oras wol mamagal Paska, gubernurca jaga nfabebas smat isa mali buica. Smat ta i nfabebas i cia nderera smat lalo ni mauna. <verse eid="MRK 15:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MRK 15:7" />Oras tina, En smat isa ngahnyo Barabas. I re ni delna rlawang Pamareta Roma ta mali batang Israel. I ncunb bui, ningalena i ire ni delna rpune smat oras ta si re pamarenta Roma rfakotalena. <verse eid="MRK 15:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MRK 15:8" />Gabe mali wol mamagal cia, smatna lal ta rlafo mali gubernur Pilatus i. Si rdore bo nfabebas smat faisa mali buica laisa re ta i npeie tona.<verse eid="MRK 15:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="MRK 15:9" />Gabe Pilatuse nfautno si, “Mewe fmauna ya ifabebas smat Yahudina nimew Kolano tae?” <verse eid="MRK 15:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MRK 15:10" />Pilatuse nu laina, ningalena i nto, imamna riri ta rfabobokona rpo Yesus lali ii ningalena si riri le Yesus. Gabe Pilatuse nuna ma smat lalo tae osta rdore bo rfabebas Yesus, Barabas pa.<verse eid="MRK 15:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="MRK 15:11" />Ga imamna riri ta rfabobokona dua smat laloca bo si rdor Pilatuse nfabebas Barabas.<verse eid="MRK 15:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="MRK 15:12" />Gabe Pilatuse nfautno si hawe, “Gabe laina, ahai ta ya nane ipeo smat ta mew fu smat Yahudina riri Kolano i tae?”<verse eid="MRK 15:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="MRK 15:13" />Rlonga laina, si rgigam hawe, “Salipi to I ya!”<verse eid="MRK 15:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="MRK 15:14" />Gabe Pilatuse nfautno si, “I npei ahai ta mayaina?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MRK 15:14">Ga smat laloca rgigamna rfacicoal si hawe, “Fsalipi to I ya!”<verse eid="MRK 15:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="MRK 15:15" />Ga Pilatuse bo nfasangnang smat laloca wlorina, i nfabebas Barabas bo sil, taga i ncula rpun Yesus rpake wala ta mali cicapona mdalim. Fola tina, i npo Yesus lali sili bo si rcalip I.<verse eid="MRK 15:15" /></para>
  <para style="s">Tentarana rlal Yesus fare du I</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="MRK 15:16" />Fola tina, tentarana dut Yesus lali gagaw ta i mali gubernurca ni istanaca ni kintalna, taga dololaw si riri del tentarana farumi ta en manana rfayalo si. <verse eid="MRK 15:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MRK 15:17" />Si rfapake Yesuse juba ungu laisa ta kolanona jaga rpake, taga si rpei siseping isa mali wala ta ni sogana taga rfapake Yesus mali bobokona. <verse eid="MRK 15:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MRK 15:18" />Fola tina, si dakale rcuba I, si du laitane, “Susa to smat Yahudina riri kolanoca!” <verse eid="MRK 15:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MRK 15:19" />Fare si rpun Yesuse bobokoca rpake sop, si ditfo I, taga si rlu nap dakale rcuba I. <verse eid="MRK 15:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MRK 15:20" />Si rngengeo fola I, folana si du I, si rcalawe i hawe juba ungu ta rfapake i cia, taga rfapake i hawe I ni juba molangca.<verse eid="MRK 15:20" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesuse rcalipi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="MRK 15:21" />Mali lalingca fapaluan, si rfadukduk re smat isa ngahnyo Simon. Simon tae smat Kirene i, Aleksander fare Rufuse hma. I taga nlafo mali Bendarca potalil mali. Gabe tentarana rgega i bo npapa Yesuse ni salipca.<verse eid="MRK 15:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="MRK 15:22" />Si dut Yesus lali gagaw isa ngahnyo Golgota, ta ningale, ‘Gagaw ta long bakbako i.’ <verse eid="MRK 15:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MRK 15:23" />Rlafo mali gagaw cia, tentarana rpo Yesus anggur ta rfulta i re lalaw ta ngahnyo mur. Ga Yesuse nailow pa bo ndomna. <verse eid="MRK 15:23" /><verse number="24-25" style="v" sid="MRK 15:24-25" />Fola tina, orasna ttok faisiwe dororam isube si rcalip Yesus. Fare si rcibit lot bo rto ise ta bo nduk Yesuse ni kabayaca. <verse eid="MRK 15:24-25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MRK 15:26" />Ta npei denabe Yesuse rcalipina en rlefo mali fafan ungo isa taga rpakuai mali salipca puisona. Ni lefoanna laitane, “Tae smat Yahudina riri kolanoca.”<verse eid="MRK 15:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="MRK 15:27" />Manana si rcalip perampok silu bena farerer re Yesus, isaca i mali Yesuse ni welana, isaca i mali Yesuse ni balitna. [<verse eid="MRK 15:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="MRK 15:28" />Yesuse rcalipina nfarerer re perampok tasa, tina tderera ta rlefoe to mali Jou ni Kitabca, ta liona laitane, “Si rpei I laisa re smat ta wlorina mayaina.”]<verse eid="MRK 15:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="MRK 15:29" />Smat ta rdel mali Yesuse ni salipca nbona jowa bobokorina ningalena riri le Yesus. Si du “He Amu, Awe osta mfamop Ebai Sombayang Mamagalca taga mpei hawe mnuwona wol pitol paga? <verse eid="MRK 15:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MRK 15:30" />Gabe laina, tane to Awe mduri mali salip cia bo mfasalamate nim dirica!”<verse eid="MRK 15:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="MRK 15:31" />Laina bena re imamna riri ta rfabobokona fare guru agama Yahudi ta rto Musa ni Kitab silim tasa, si le ma riri le Yesus bena. Si du laitane, “Smate nesa I nfasalamat si, ga I ni dirica tutuling nfasalamat I pa! <verse eid="MRK 15:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="MRK 15:32" />Gabe laisa Aw Mesias, smat Israelna riri kolanoca, mduri to mali salip cia, bo ame bisa kem fare kdela Aw.” Smat silu ta rcalip si farerer re Yesus tasa riri le Yesus bena.<verse eid="MRK 15:32" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesuse nmat</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="MRK 15:33" />Orasna ttok yafasa re failu wolca wlal, farumi batang tina dororam denabe ttok faicol malingin. <verse eid="MRK 15:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="MRK 15:34" />Neta ttok faicol malingin cia, Yesuse n'gigamna nfacicoal I npake mauting Aram, I nu, “Eloi, Eloi lama sabakhtani?” Ta ningale, ‘Jou Lahatalla, Ya nik Jou I, pesaga Jou mfateam Yana?’<verse eid="MRK 15:34" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="MRK 15:35" />Rlonga tina, smat sifis ta dosal mana tasa du laitane, “Ya mlonga, I nololaw nabi Elia,” <verse eid="MRK 15:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="MRK 15:36" />Fare smat isa fatoal be nyal spons taga ncoula mali anggur ta nkakaninca. Taga sponca nising i mali sop isa taga nfadahle i lali Yesuse fmona bo ncoraf I. Oras smat cia npei laina, I nu laitane, “Ite ttotomanca bo tem, faramane ga nabi Elia nlafo nfadurea I.” <verse eid="MRK 15:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="MRK 15:37" />Fare Yesuse n'gigamna nfacicoali, fare I wlaya morit.<verse eid="MRK 15:37" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="MRK 15:38" />Oras ta Yesuse wlaya moritna, kain mamagal ta i mali Ebai Sombayang Mamagalca, nmarasekan fapaluan puis denabe nap.<verse eid="MRK 15:38" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="MRK 15:39" />En komedan kompi isa nosal mali Yesuse nbona oras Yesuse rcalip ina. Oras cia, i nem Yesuse nmatna gabe mfalaina e, i nu, “Ga fatutua to I tae Jou Lahatalla Ntu i!”<verse eid="MRK 15:39" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="MRK 15:40" />Manana en bena maping sifis rningningo Yesus ga dalaspa. Mali sili tina, en Salome, Maria smat Magdala, fare Maria ta ndadi Yakobus ta poica fare Yosese hnye. <verse eid="MRK 15:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="MRK 15:41" />Si tane ta rderera fare rleleane Yesus oras si mali Galileana. En bena mapinge nesa mana ta rlafo mali Yerusalem farerer re Yesus.<verse eid="MRK 15:41" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesuse rgaile I mali piling gowana</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42-43" style="v" sid="MRK 15:42-43" />En smat isa ngahnyo Yusuf. Yusuf tae smati mali Arimatea i, i re agama Yahudina pukpuk isa ta tigo molang ta ngahnyo Mahkama Agama. Gabe smatna lal rcuba i. I ma ntotoman Jou Lahatalla oras ta bo Nkawasa ndadi Kolano mali I ni smatna. Wol ta Yesuse nmatna, neta mali smat agama Yahudina riri wol ta si rciap. Wol cia, si nane rfatoto farumi riri karajanna wolca ncop paubena, ningalena mali wol sabat si bisa rkarajan panto. Gabe bo dorame to, Yusufe nfacicoale wlona nfan lali Pilatus i, ndor Yesuse ni mayatca bo n'gaile i. <verse eid="MRK 15:42-43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="MRK 15:44" />Rlonga Yesuse nmate to, Pilatuse nherang. Gabe i nololaw komedan kompica taga nfautno i, “Fatutua Yesuse nmate to?”<verse eid="MRK 15:44" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" sid="MRK 15:45" />Gabe komedanca nu, “Fatutua apa! Yesuse nmate to.” Oras Pilatuse nto Yesuse nmate to, I npo kawasa lali Yusuf i nyal Yesuse ni mayatca bo n'gaile i.<verse eid="MRK 15:45" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="46" style="v" sid="MRK 15:46" />Gabe Yusufe nfane ga n'gon kain bubulang ta mufufna, taga ndurea Yesuse ni mayatca mali salipca. Fola tina, i nopi Yesuse ni mayatca npake kain bubulangca taga nising i mali piling goa ta rgali to mali popo pat, taga i nfaulol pat mamagal isa bo ntiban bawa piling cia.<verse eid="MRK 15:46" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="47" style="v" sid="MRK 15:47" />Tinana, Maria smat Magdala fare Maria Yosese ni mama, si rtarokira gagaw ta dising Yesuse ni mayatca.<verse eid="MRK 15:47" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MRK 15" />
  <chapter number="16" style="c" sid="MRK 16" />
  <para style="s">Yesuse npaling hawe</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MRK 16:1" />Sabtuca ni doram, orasna maralapise to wol Sabatca, wol ta smat agama Yahudina rkarajan pa, Salome, Maria smat Magdala fare Maria Yakobuse hnye, rfane rgon egat ta pauna mafia bo rmomsa Yesuse ni mayatca. <verse eid="MRK 16:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MRK 16:2" />Gabe wol gerejaca, orasna wolca bo nca, si rfan lali piling goaca. <verse eid="MRK 16:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MRK 16:3" />Mali lalingca fapaluan si rfauwo si, “Ya, gabe tlafo pulina, ise ta bo nfaulol pat cia bo ite tcung namu pilingca lolo?” <verse eid="MRK 16:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MRK 16:4" />Bo rdahle Yesuse ni pilingca to, si dem pat cia namolole to. Bo temna patca nmamagalna gaole.<verse eid="MRK 16:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="MRK 16:5" />Oras ta si rcung namul pilingca lolo, si rgarayan ningalena si dem waiman isa npake juba bubulang ntotolang mali welana. <verse eid="MRK 16:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MRK 16:6" />Gabe waimanca nua si, “Mati famcaitna! Mewe fiyawa Yesus smat Nasaret ta rcalipi cia. I npaling hawe. I mantane pa. Co mewe fem! Tae gagaw ta si dising I ni mayatcana. <verse eid="MRK 16:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MRK 16:7" />Gabe tane, fpalane mewe to, fabinga I ni muritna fare Petrus bena fu, ‘Yesuse ntuba lali batang Galilea to. Pulina mew osta fem I, laisa ta I nua mewe tona.’ ”<verse eid="MRK 16:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="MRK 16:8" />Rlonga tina, si damcait denabe damderer gabe rcapang mali piling cia. Poko be caitca, mali lalingca fapaluanna si isa-isa liori pa.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MRK 16:8">[Oras si rlafo, si rfabinga Yesuse ni fatnaw tina lali Petrus i fare murit ta nesana. Si rmautingna mlanga pa. Fola tina, Yesuse ntutuling npake ni muritna rfabinga Abar Mafia lali smatna, mulain po lawo denabe po lewo. Abar Mafia cia mfalaisa smatna rtub re Jou Lahatallana denabe lali. Abar Mafia cia namolang fare imana turus.]<verse eid="MRK 16:8" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesuse nfaeme ni dirica lali ni muritna</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="MRK 16:9" />Gerejaca dororam isube, oras Yesuse npalinge to, Yesuse nfaem I ni dirica lali Maria smat Magdalaca. Maria cia ta Yesuse nfaungo setan sifit mali ii. <verse eid="MRK 16:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MRK 16:10" />Gabe Maria nfane ga nfabinga smat ta jaga rderera Yesusna, ahai ta i nemna. Oras ciana si wlorina kangela gabe rtangis. <verse eid="MRK 16:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MRK 16:11" />Ga oras ta si rlonga Maria nu Yesuse npaling hawe fare i nem I, si rdela pa.<verse eid="MRK 16:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="MRK 16:12" />Fola tina, Yesus nfaeme ni dirica lali murit smat silu ta bo rfan lali pnu i. Oras ciana si rfayala Yesus pa, ningalena si dem Yesuse ni kler nesa. Lomanta mnu taga rfayala I. <verse eid="MRK 16:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MRK 16:13" />Gabe smat silu tasa rpalanci ga rfabinga riri del ta nesana. Ga si riri delna ma rdela pa bena.<verse eid="MRK 16:13" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesuse ncula ni muritna</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="MRK 16:14" />Morco napna, Yesuse nfaemi lali ni murit yafasa re isa tasa oras ciana si rceli. Gabe Yesuse ntolea si, ningalena si wlorina cicoal fare si rdela smat ta demna pa, I npaling hawe. <verse eid="MRK 16:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MRK 16:15" />Fola tina Yesuse nua si, “Ffane to mali farumi dunia tae, bo ffabinga Abar Mafia mali Jou Lahatalla I lali farumi smatna. <verse eid="MRK 16:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MRK 16:16" />Ise ta ndela fare nduk waya rsisopca, i osta ncalamat. Ga ise ta ndela Ya pa, i osta ncalamat pa ga nduk sal. <verse eid="MRK 16:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MRK 16:17" />Smat ta rdela Ya tina, Jou Lahatalla osta npo si kawasa bo rpei fafayal laisa tane: Si osta rfaungo setanna rpake Ya ngahnyok, si osta rmauting rpake mauting ta si rto bahnga paubena, <verse eid="MRK 16:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MRK 16:18" />si le ma osta dice gu, fare si biarega rdom racong rpei paisapa. Si osta rfatige kakamorina mali smat ta dowilna, fare smat ta dowilna rmafia.”<verse eid="MRK 16:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="MRK 16:19" />Jou Yesuse nmautinge fola re ni muritna, I ndawil nais sorogai, taga ntotolang mali gagaw ta nmafia cia mali Jou Lahatalla ni welana. <verse eid="MRK 16:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MRK 16:20" />Fola tina, Yesuse ni muritna rfan lali farumi smatna rfabinga Jou Yesus Kristuse ni Abar Mafia. Ga Jouca ma n'gali si rpei mujizat bo smatna ndadi rto Jou Lahatalla nmautingna fatutua.<verse eid="MRK 16:20" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MRK 16" />
</usx>